{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T08:44:26.654Z","ordinal":332956,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a1723b-889e-76a0-b13d-ba6b5130117a","author":"/root/t4_runner_independent_review","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/t4_runner_independent_review\nPayload:\nACCEPT — the T4 fixture receipts are bound to actual `run_command` results, and task-controlled text cannot forge hanging or full-disk evidence through the transcript. I inspected the code read-only; I did not run tests or access held-out data.\n\nOne evidence limitation: `containmentCleaned` records end-of-task supervisor cleanup, not cleanup specifically attributable to that individual command."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17224-c0fe-79f1-a031-0db884e4ebbb","create_time":1792917866.6542401}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":16621}}
