r will implement after recording request; no local tests while SUITE held.\\n3961:2026-10-25T07:54:06Z /root PR213_CANDIDATE_IDENTITY_REMEDIATION: Committed and pushed 8230a47031d415b0a88c56eeede475166dfbae0c on base05994a40; boundary request for cli/src/core/candidate.ts recorded and fulfilled after no competing claim. Requirements enforcement PASS 123 rows (108 tested,6 partial,2 implemented,7 open,12 exact-RC deferrals); diff-check PASS. Exact CI40174445492 Node22/24 in progress; CodeQL40174445513 in progress. Independent re-review and behavioral tests pending; SUITE remains Kimi-held.\\n3962:2026-10-25T07:55:06Z /root PR213_EXACT_HEAD_9337AA6: PR head is 9337aa6852b2ecd339573f227f8b1850632badaf, current main base05994a40, 8 files/727 additions/73 deletions. Diff SHA256 c39302f8f91e9bbdcb3f0925ee7f0ca799b5550f69b4610a3293c201bf7d91e0. Diff-check and requirements --enforce PASS (123 rows; 108 tested,6 partial,2 implemented,7 open; 12 exact-RC deferrals). Exact CI40174568856 and CodeQL40174568839 queued. Older 8230 CI cancelled after fixture-only follow-up; older 7a5 and 5b CI cancelled on infinite-loop review finding. SUITE claim remains held by Kimi; no local test.\\n3964:2026-10-25T09:08:00Z /root T4_SCORER_AND_SMOKE_TESTS_PASS: The T4 scorer integrity case passed 1/1 and the two T4 smoke cases passed 2/2 on ubuntu-desktop using a snapshot of exact base 05994a4 plus only this claimed slice diff. Source test runner used a fresh isolated HOME/XDG and the exact-main CI package harness-core; no inference or held-out data. An initial attempt under /tmp was correctly refused by the harness protected-runtime-root policy and is recorded as an environment-path setup failure; relocating the disposable snapshot under /home/mike allowed the tests to run. Local Kimi SUITE remains active; no local tests were started.\\n3969:2026-10-25T08:29:25Z /root PLAN10_PR10c_T4_FIXTURE_EVIDENCE: Expanded claimed T4 runner slice in /home/mike/nexus-wt/plan10-pr10c-t4 from base 05994a40c6e13bdaad9348fe62751220f7f53099. Added eval/t4_fixtures.mjs to validate public task metadata and derive hanging-test/full-disk evidence only from a matching exact Nexus run_command transcript, observed timeout/ENOSPC result, and outer cgroup cleanup with zero survivors; full-disk storage cap must match the configured resource contract. Wired evidence into run records/scorer and documented schema; added synthetic integrity and validation regressions. Node syntax checks and diff-check pass. No behavioral tests run because KimiCode-defect-scan currently owns SUITE and is actively running make test in defect-provider-client-blockers-snapshot. Fresh read-only independent review requested from t4_runner_independent_review. No qualification, inference, held-out access, push, or PR.\\n3970:2026-10-25T08:31:00Z /root PLAN10_PR10c_BOUNDARY_REQUEST: Fresh read-only independent review of the hanging/full-disk prototype returned CHANGES_REQUIRED: Nexus TaskExecutionResult does not expose json.messages, and string matching on tool output can be forged. Correct evidence needs an opt-in structured run_command receipt (exact invocation digest, runner exit code/timed_out, and observed ENOSPC output classification) emitted by Nexus CLI and consumed by eval. PLAN-10 PR-10c safe change boundary includes eval/ and cli/test but excludes cli/src/agent.ts, cli/src/core/app.ts, and cli/src/types.ts; CONCURRENCY §1/§6 requires stopping and recording this boundary request before editing outside the slice. No CLI source files edited or claimed. Focused test/eval_integrity.test.ts completed 27/29: the new fixture validation/evidence checks and T4 scorer passed; two environment-dependent pre-existing failures: default cli/dist unavailable in this worktree, and cgroup memory fixture observed SIGKILL with 3 oom_kills before expected process-limit assertion. Full SUITE remains held by active KimiCode-defect-scan run. Prototype is not accepted or committed; T4 fixture evidence remains blocked pending scope-boundary resolution and revised exact-runner receipts.\\n3972:2026-10-25T09:20:00Z /root PLAN10_PR10c_BOUNDARY_APPROVED: Approved narrow boundary extension after reviewer showed TaskExecutionResult omits tool messages and text evidence is forgeable; claimed previously free hot files cli/src/agent.ts, cli/src/core/app.ts, cli/src/types.ts. Plan is opt-in eval-only structured run_command receipts bound to actual invocation and runner output; no user-facing/default behavior change, thresholds or held-out access. Existing prototype remains untrusted until replaced and reviewed.\\n\"}}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17224-c0fe-79f1-a031-0db884e4ebbb","create_time":1792917884.8755233}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
