{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T08:52:51.369Z","ordinal":333347,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1723f-d7c7-7d81-90fc-19d6aade9feb","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016addc36294dc81a08f59c3b52f331a71","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"That `EINVAL` is reproducible and points to a real test-path defect: `resourceProbeProblem` starts the supervisor without opening its required control pipe on file descriptor 4. I’m fixing that wiring, then I’ll rerun the failing preflight test and the full evaluator integrity file. The resource-limit fixture itself passed once given its correctly bounded tmpfs."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1792918370616,"completed_at_ms":1792918371369}}
