4 proxy smoke 2/2 PASS. Broader resource-contract check confirmed memory OOM and process-count enforcement, then failed at workspace-storage assertion because this host uses shared /dev/shm rather than required dedicated size-capped tmpfs; recorded as environment prerequisite, not pass. No held-out tasks/inference. Exact source base 05994a40c6e13bdaad9348fe62751220f7f53099; independent review pending.\n2026-10-25T09:12:00Z /root PLAN-10_PR-10c_FOLLOWUP_FIXES: Addressed independent T4 review findings in claimed worktree /home/mike/nexus-wt/plan10-pr10c-t4, branch v1/plan-10-pr10c-t4-qualification, exact base 05994a40c6e13bdaad9348fe62751220f7f53099. Scorer now requires delivered SIGTERM during an active inference turn, first process exit by SIGTERM, resume exit 0, and resulting turn COMPLETED; runner records these observations rather than unconditional resumed=true. Supervisor defers cgroup cleanup/escalation until SIGTERM grace elapses even when main child exits, allowing descendants to flush. Added regressions for missing resume evidence/inactive signal and descendant flush. On ubuntu-desktop isolated snapshot with fresh HOME/XDG: T4 scorer+supervisor focused patterns 2/2 PASS; T4 smoke patterns 2/2 PASS; diff-check PASS. No inference, held-out task, or full suite. Independent read-only re-review requested; no commit/PR until disposition.\n2026-10-25T09:18:00Z /root PLAN-10_PR-10c_WRAPPER_SIGNAL_FIX: Follow-up independent review identified that child.close observes the systemd-run wrapper, while the contained supervisor reports the actual payload signal. Replaced scorer input with payloadExitSignal sourced from containment.final.signal; recorded supervisorWrapperExitSignal separately for diagnosis. Added regression rejecting wrapper-only SIGTERM. Exact branch base remains 05994a40c6e13bdaad9348fe62751220f7f53099; diff-check clean. Ubuntu desktop isolated HOME/XDG targeted T4 scorer and descendant-grace cases PASS 2/2 after correction. Fresh independent read-only re