{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T09:14:33.816Z","ordinal":334345,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016addc878217881a093e9b961b36728a2","status":"completed","call_id":"call_0b3bc4b0acee4eb99dda56a3bbddd96f","name":"exec","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"cat >> /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims.log <<'EOF'\\n2026-10-25T09:14:29Z /root SUITE_SAFE_BOUNDARY_HANDOFF_REQUEST: Rechecked SUITE owner KimiCode-defect-scan (claim since 08:08Z; owner process 1072398 still live, but claim scope now states short local-mock provider-client reproduction). The previously observed make/npm/run_tests/node-test process tree PIDs 45708/64644/64659/64666/64677 are absent; no suite result or claim release is recorded after the 08:59Z progress entry. Requested via shared coordination record: report terminal suite result/log location and release SUITE, or explicitly transfer it at a safe boundary. Claim remains protected; no local suite started and no ownership change made.\\nEOF\",\"workdir\":\"/home/mike/nexus-code\",\"max_output_tokens\":200});\ntext(r.output);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17255-e965-7c11-ad6a-fa374f060967","create_time":1792919672.1329825}}}
