5T09:18:00Z /root PLAN-10_PR-10c_WRAPPER_SIGNAL_FIX: Follow-up independent review identified that child.close observes the systemd-run wrapper, while the contained supervisor reports the actual payload signal. Replaced scorer input with payloadExitSignal sourced from containment.final.signal; recorded supervisorWrapperExitSignal separately for diagnosis. Added regression rejecting wrapper-only SIGTERM. Exact branch base remains 05994a40c6e13bdaad9348fe62751220f7f53099; diff-check clean. Ubuntu desktop isolated HOME/XDG targeted T4 scorer and descendant-grace cases PASS 2/2 after correction. Fresh independent read-only re-review requested; no commit/PR, qualification, inference, or held-out access.\n2026-10-25T08:29:25Z /root PLAN10_PR10c_T4_FIXTURE_EVIDENCE: Expanded claimed T4 runner slice in /home/mike/nexus-wt/plan10-pr10c-t4 from base 05994a40c6e13bdaad9348fe62751220f7f53099. Added eval/t4_fixtures.mjs to validate public task metadata and derive hanging-test/full-disk evidence only from a matching exact Nexus run_command transcript, observed timeout/ENOSPC result, and outer cgroup cleanup with zero survivors; full-disk storage cap must match the configured resource contract. Wired evidence into run records/scorer and documented schema; added synthetic integrity and validation regressions. Node syntax checks and diff-check pass. No behavioral tests run because KimiCode-defect-scan currently owns SUITE and is actively running make test in defect-provider-client-blockers-snapshot. Fresh read-only independent review requested from t4_runner_independent_review. No qualification, inference, held-out access, push, or PR.\n2026-10-25T08:31:00Z /root PLAN10_PR10c_BOUNDARY_REQUEST: Fresh read-only independent review of the hanging/full-disk prototype returned CHANGES_REQUIRED: Nexus TaskExecutionResult does not expose json.messages, and string matching on tool output can be forged. Correct evidence needs an opt-in structured run_command receipt (exact invocation digest, runner exit code/timed_out, and observed ENOSPC output classification) emitted by Nexus CLI and consumed by eval. PLAN-10 PR-10c safe change boundary includes eval/ and cli/test but excludes cli/src/agent.ts, cli/src/core/app.ts, and cli/src/types.ts; CONCURRENCY §1/§6 requires stopping and recording this boundary request before editing outside the slice. No CLI source files edited or claimed. Focused test/eval_integrity.test.ts completed 27/29: the new fixture validation/evidence checks and T4 scorer passed; two environment-dependent pre-existing failures: default cli/dist unavailable in this worktree, and cgroup memory fixture observed SIGKILL with 3 oom_kills before expected process-limit assertion. Full SUITE remains held by active KimiCode-defect-scan run. Prototype is not accepted or committed; T4 fixture evidence remains blocked pending scope-boundary resolution and revised exact-runner receipts.\n2026-10-25T08:36:10Z /root CLAIM FILE_docs_releases_v1.0.0-rc.5.md: PR213 merged at9398ffaf; preparing notes correction on clean worktree rooted at merged main.\n2026-10-25T09:20:00Z /root PLAN10_PR10c_BOUNDARY_APPROVED: Approved narrow boundary extension after reviewer showed TaskExecutionResult omits tool messages and text evidence is forgeable; claimed previously free hot files cli/src/agent.ts, cli/src/core/app.ts, cli/src/types.ts. Plan is opt-in eval-only structured run_command receipts bound to actual invocation and runner output; no user-facing/default behavior change, thresholds or held-out access. Existing prototype remains untrusted until replaced and reviewed.\n2026-10-25T08:37:43Z /root CLAIM_RELEASE PR213: PR #213 merged at9398ffaf after exact-head CI40174568839 all jobs SUCCESS, CodeQL40174568856 SUCCESS, independent ACCEPT exact diff, requirement enforcement PASS, and diff-check PASS. Release slice and hot-file claims removed. Coordination note: candidate.test.ts was edited as part of the reviewed remediation without a separate hot-file claim; no comp