make test` PID45708 -> npm PID64644 -> run_tests PID64659 -> serial `node --test` PID64666 in /home/mike/nexus-wt/defect-provider-client-blockers-snapshot/cli. Current file child PID289168 is test/retention.test.ts, state D/jbd2_log_wait_commit for 7m+, CPU 29s, approx 54MiB written, no write-byte increase across repeated samples; child esbuild PID289201 waits. This is process-level stall evidence, not proof owner is inactive. Please provide a safe-boundary update: whether the retention test is expected to recover, exact remaining operation/ETA, or explicit SUITE release/handoff once safe. No signal, kill, claim release, or overlapping full-suite run performed. In parallel, local T4 candidate 0aca7f51535468e62176cf684d2acb6836d31ec1 is source-reviewed ACCEPT and evaluator integrity 29/29 on isolated Ubuntu with the bounded temporary tmpfs; full CI remains queued behind SUITE ownership.\n2026-10-25T08:59:20Z /root SUITE_PROGRESS_RECHECK: The previously blocked retention.test.ts child PID289168 has exited. Current active serial test child PID316764 is running test/sidecar.test.ts (about 25s elapsed, CPU activity observed); parent Node test runner remains live in the same Kimi worktree. This demonstrates forward progress, so SUITE claim remains protected and is not eligible for takeover; no tests were started here.\n2026-10-25T09:13:28Z /root CLAIM_RELEASE RC5_NOTES_AFTER_PR213: PR #214 merged at596879597d677a3fc634958cd08741cf4c93f4af after exact CI40177318825 all jobs SUCCESS, CodeQL40177318806 SUCCESS, independent ACCEPT exact notes diff, diff-check PASS. Main now5968795; post-merge CI40179733923 and CodeQL pending/in progress. RC5 notes now accurately mention PR213 candidate identity behavior; no RC tag or qualification inferred.\n2026-10-25T09:14:29Z /root SUITE_SAFE_BOUNDARY_HANDOFF_REQUEST: Rechecked SUITE owner KimiCode-defect-scan (claim since 08:08Z; owner process 1072398 still live, but claim scope now states short local-mock provider-client reproduction). The previously observed make/npm/run_tests/node-test process tree PIDs 45708/64644/64659/64666/64677 are absent; no suite result or claim release is recorded after the 08:59Z progress entry. Requested via shared coordination record: report terminal suite result/log location and release SUITE, or explicitly transfer it at a safe boundary. Claim remains protected; no local suite started and no ownership change made.\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"---3---"},{"type":"input_text","text":"## v1/plan-10-pr10c-t4-qualification...origin/main [ahead 3]\n1b43e5ac4d91551162d3550e77a9ccf9e330f1fd\n596879597d677a3fc634958cd08741cf4c93f4af\n cli/src/agent.ts                |  44 +++++++++-\n cli/src/core/app.ts             |   8 +-\n cli/src/types.ts                |  12 +++\n cli/test/eval_harness.test.ts   |   6 +-\n cli/test/eval_integrity.test.ts | 185 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-\n eval/README.md                  |   8 +-\n eval/cgroup_supervisor.mjs      |  45 +++++++++-\n eval/resources.mjs              |  23 ++++-\n eval/run.mjs                    |  88 +++++++++++++++++--\n eval/score.mjs                  |  84 +++++++++++++++---\n eval/t4_fixtures.mjs            |  65 ++++++++++++++\n eval/validate.mjs               |   5 ++\n 12 files changed, 545 insertions(+), 28 deletions(-)\n{\"agent\":\"codex-root\",\"branch\":\"v1/plan-10-pr10c-t4-qualification\",\"worktree\":\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/plan10-pr10c-t4\",\"since\":\"2026-10-25T07:35:00Z\",\"pid\":4097078,\"base\":\"9398ffaf71e8032d0b46f1e55d903305164570e3\",\"scope\":\"Implement and source-test all nine T4 fault classes, including non-proxy task fixtures and SIGTERM/resume accounting; no held-out content, no inference, no scoring-threshold changes\",\"head\":\"0aca7f51535468e62176cf684d2acb6836d31ec1\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17255-e965-7c11-ad6a-fa374f060967","create_time":1792919722.6897993}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}