ic%21%20It%27s%20free%20for%20OSS%20and%20offers%20a%20free%20trial%20for%20proprietary%20code)\\n\\n</dd>\\n</dl>\\n</details>\\n\\n\\n<sub>Comment `@coderabbitai help` to get the list of available commands.</sub>\\n\\n<!-- tips_end -->\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-25T09:16:54Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":true,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/215#issuecomment-6395841371\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":false},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABfTluaw\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"### Independent Review: ACCEPT (Head `1b43e5ac4d91551162d3550e77a9ccf9e330f1fd`)\\n\\n**Disposition: ACCEPT** (pending active CI matrix completion)\\n\\n- **Base Commit**: `596879597d677a3fc634958cd08741cf4c93f4af` (`origin/main`)\\n- **Candidate Head**: `1b43e5ac4d91551162d3550e77a9ccf9e330f1fd`\\n- **Diff SHA-256**: `b83029cc8d6cb897057c3ac4dea1ea66176e3682f1476ba9ea5992f84f5dbedd` (+545 / -28 across 12 files)\\n- **Whitespace Check**: `git diff --check` **PASS** (zero trailing whitespace/markers)\\n- **CodeQL Run [40179983378](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40179983378)**: **✓ SUCCESS** (1m29s)\\n- **CI Run [40179983377](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40179983377)**: actively running matrix jobs\\n\\n#### Subsystem Verification\\n\\n1. **Evidenced Tool Receipts (`cli/src/agent.ts`, `cli/src/core/app.ts`, `cli/src/types.ts`)**:\\n   - Introduces sanitized `EvaluationToolReceipt` capturing `commandSha256`, runner exit codes, timeout status, and pre/post available storage bytes. Gated strictly behind `process.env.NEXUS_EVAL_TOOL_RECEIPTS === \\\"1\\\"`.\\n   - Prevents transcript prose injection or fabricated agent output from spoofing T4 fault recovery evidence.\\n\\n2. **Evidenced T4 Scoring (`eval/score.mjs`, `eval/t4_fixtures.mjs`)**:\\n   - Enforces the full 9 fault classes × 5 runs per class = 45 runs denominator for T4 qualification.\\n   - For `hanging_test_command` and `full_disk`, derives evidence only from real execution receipts matched against the task fixture specification, with verified cgroup containment cleanup.\\n   - For `sigterm_resume`, requires observed SIGTERM delivery during the active turn, graceful process exit, clean resumption, and clean containment.\\n\\n3. **Supervisor Control & Containment (`eval/cgroup_supervisor.mjs`, `eval/resources.mjs`)**:\\n   - Supervisor pipe (fd 4) communicates structured control messages without polluting stdout/stderr.\\n   - Controlled grace period before SIGKILL escalation allows clean descendant shutdown. Zero survivor cgroup verification enforced.\\n\\n4. **Comprehensive Test Suite (`cli/test/eval_integrity.test.ts`)**:\\n   - Regression tests verify that missing classes, partial runs, forged proxy claims, or unevidenced runner faults fail the T4 gate, and confirms graceful SIGTERM handling with descendant preservation.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-25T09:21:22Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/215#issuecomment-6395883115\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true}],\"latestReviews\":[{\"id\":\"\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"github-advanced-security\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"NONE\",\"body\":\"\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-25T09:18:15Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"reactionGroups\":[],\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"commit\":{\"oid\":\"\"}}],\"mergeStateStatus\":\"BLOCKED\",\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"reviewRequests\":[],\"reviews\":[{\"id\":\"PRR_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABUFCRIg\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"github-advanced-security\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"NONE\",\"body\":\"\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-25T09:18:15Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"reactionGroups\":[],\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"commit\":{\"oid\":\"1b43e5ac4d91551162d3550e77a9ccf9e330f1fd\"}}]}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":671908598}},"started