{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T09:40:26.764Z","ordinal":335378,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17267-b4a8-7073-9d2a-32da76e0ee35","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-6464c03c-e6c8-4c61-b458-e4a66bccebe6","server":"mcp-search","tool":"work_state_read","arguments":{"list":"nexus-v1-release","includeClosed":false},"pluginId":"claude-mem@claude-mem-local","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"- nexus-v1-release: pr133_ci=Node20/22/24 and CodeQL passed exact head; Linux packaging run 39665020828 active, pr133_head=6f522952bb50d956f259068b0a34151f614c956a, next=Wait for Linux job terminal. If green, integrate PR213 through protected path only; then verify exact main CI/CodeQL. Refresh RC5 release notes for the merged feature and obtain fresh review/checks. Continue final release gates; public Issue #1 has no custodian response, no accepted installed RC, no required human acceptance, no stable v1.0.0 publication., current_main=596879597d677a3fc634958cd08741cf4c93f4af; PR #214 merged., sbom=PR134 merged as 049880f; exact PR CI39679493728 all4 SUCCESS, CodeQL39679493753 SUCCESS, focused SBOM closure tests 10/10 PASS, independent ACCEPT; post-merge main gates pass, active_claims=Release publisher remains active; SUITE now released after exact main CI and CodeQL terminal success; no other local test started, blocking_decision=RC2 Node floor: awaiting user's choice between DEC-12 >=20 with EOL disclosure and newer reported no-EOL mandate >=22, pr126_status=Merged 2026-10-21T23:16:39Z as f8ba4c1248d400ac321aec1d08b74437a1c8d70b after exact-head CI run39688533586 all four success and CodeQL39688533646 success. Postmerge main CI39692357597 and CodeQL39692357575 in progress. PR127/128 old checks are stale because base ffad03f; must refresh/requalify serially. PR135 CI active on previous main 049880f; refresh after terminal., pr135_status=Exact head 771