es integrity.check exceed 5s and warn. Focused concurrent-batch fix underway; not yet tested., doctor_d1b_pr=PR #155 opened at https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/155; head 76b34f1d18d766b06011176a85679e7c3434ba30, base 382e0182795ad08332c30a7f798b94c525f8f068. Independent review ACCEPT. Focused doctor tests 5/5 and tsc --noEmit pass. Exact PR CI run39893335185 and CodeQL39893335167 in progress. No merge yet., main_latest_ci=Run39891501513 exact main 382e018: Node22 and Node24 full suites SUCCESS; Linux package job still in progress. CodeQL39891501527 SUCCESS. Prior PR153 post-merge run39891244410 on 429bd314 remains historical and Linux packaging in progress; not needed to combine with current-main evidence., custody_refresh=Issue #1 last updated 2026-10-22T22:08:35Z. No custodian response; 40-task manifest custody acceptance and compatibility remain external blocker. No held-out content accessed; no qualification started., doctor_broad_test=Full doctor.test.ts local run attempted after npm ci; 33 pass, 8 fail due missing built CLI/core artifacts in fresh worktree (e.g. cl\\n[Response shortened; request fewer selected records for more detail.]\"}]}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"RESULT 1\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Tool execution failed: search: server runtime is selected but configuration is incomplete (missing url, api key, or project id)\"}],\"isError\":true}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"RESULT 2\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"eaa7f3\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000029132,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":233,\"output\":\" M AGENTS.md\\n M cli/dist/agent.js\\n M cli/src/agent.ts\\n M cli/src/core/state.ts\\n M cli/test/compaction_continuity.test.ts\\nA  docs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md\\nA  docs/v1.0.0/REQUIREMENTS.md\\nA  scripts/check_requirements.mjs\\n?? cli/test/agent_prompt.test.ts\\n?? docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/\\n?? docs/v1.0.0/AUDIT.md\\n?? docs/v1.0.0/CONCURRENC