{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T09:50:47.491Z","ordinal":335812,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016addd0f4dcf481a09dd7497d100994bb","status":"completed","call_id":"call_1d4a969e0cc04e0dbc61f6bd7634a753","name":"exec","input":"const body = `## Summary\n\n- Add structured run_command receipts bound to the real task invocation and process result so task transcript text cannot fabricate T4 evidence.\n- Require observed SIGTERM/resume behavior and outer containment cleanup before scoring the relevant fault classes.\n- Fix evaluator resource preflight to preserve the supervisor control pipe while retaining fail-closed resource checks.\n- Make post-close containment cleanup idempotent so a completed, cleaned task does not start a repeating emergency-kill loop.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- Candidate: c8d374a7a2855ec0e6f43a6d4a81dc482c530099, based on main 596879597d677a3fc634958cd08741cf4c93f4af.\n- \\`node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce\\`: PASS (123 rows; 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 qualification rows remain explicitly deferred).\n- \\`git diff --check\\` and \\`node --check eval/resources.mjs\\`: PASS.\n- Exact failing CI test was reproduced on an isolated Ubuntu host: the version probe succeeded, then the evaluator stayed alive until the test's 45-second timeout.\n- After the cleanup fix, the same production version-probe storage test passed in 16.3 seconds on the isolated Ubuntu host.\n- The prior failure was in CI run 40179983377 on 1b43e5ac; it is historical for that SHA. Exact-head CI and independent review of c8d374a are pending.\n\nNo held-out content, qualification tasks, live inference, score threshold changes, or release acceptance claims are included. Please review and complete the required exact-head checks before integration.\n`;\nconst r=await tools.exec_command({cmd:`cat > /tmp/nexus-pr215-body.md <<'EOF'\\n${body}\\nEOF\\ngh pr edit 215 --body-file /tmp/nexus-pr215-body.md`,workdir:\"/home/mike/nexus-code\",yield_time_ms:10000,max_output_tokens:500});\ntext(r.output);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17267-b4a8-7073-9d2a-32da76e0ee35","create_time":1792921844.8650324}}}
