{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T09:51:19.945Z","ordinal":335840,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016addd114cf2881a091eb7cc4890dcd69","status":"completed","call_id":"call_74d1a138b13d4fcc9a607ec497c8a44e","name":"exec","input":"const body = `## Summary\n\n- Add structured run_command receipts bound to the real task invocation and process result so task transcript text cannot fabricate T4 evidence.\n- Require observed SIGTERM/resume behavior and outer containment cleanup before scoring the relevant fault classes.\n- Fix evaluator resource preflight to preserve the supervisor control pipe while retaining fail-closed resource checks.\n- Make post-close containment cleanup idempotent so a completed, cleaned task does not start a repeating emergency-kill loop.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- Candidate: c8d374a7a2855ec0e6f43a6d4a81dc482c530099, based on main 596879597d677a3fc634958cd08741cf4c93f4af.\n- \\`node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce\\`: PASS (123 rows; 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 qualification rows remain explicitly deferred).\n- \\`git diff --check\\` and \\`node --check eval/resources.mjs\\`: PASS.\n- The exact failing CI test was reproduced on an isolated Ubuntu host: version discovery succeeded, then the evaluator remained alive until the test's 45-second timeout.\n- After the fix, the same production version-probe storage test passed in 16.3 seconds on that isolated host.\n- Independent read-only review of the follow-up commit: ACCEPT. Reviewer confirmed pre-close cleanup is unchanged and post-close cleanup cannot signal a reused PID or leave timers running.\n- Previous CI run 40179983377 failed on the prior SHA 1b43e5ac and is historical. Exact-head CI and CodeQL for c8d374a are pending.\n\nNo held-out content, qualification tasks, live inference, score threshold changes, or release acceptance claims are included. Integration remains gated on the exact-head checks and review disposition.\n`;\nconst r=await tools.exec_command({cmd:`cat > /tmp/nexus-pr215-body.md <<'EOF'\\n${body}\\nEOF\\ngh pr edit 215 --body-file /tmp/nexus-pr215-body.md\\ngh pr list --state open --limit 30 --json number,title,headRefName,updatedAt,isDraft,reviewDecision,mergeStateStatus,url`,workdir:\"/home/mike/nexus-code\",yield_time_ms:10000,max_output_tokens:3000});\ntext(r.output);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17267-b4a8-7073-9d2a-32da76e0ee35","create_time":1792921876.8115792}}}
