{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T11:08:58.433Z","ordinal":337007,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17267-b4a8-7073-9d2a-32da76e0ee35","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-ba0b2448-b318-4363-a6bd-a238052cbf26","process_id":"21230","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","cat .git/nexus-claims/RELEASE_PUBLISHER/owner.json; git log --oneline --decorate v1.0.0-rc.4..origin/main; git diff --stat v1.0.0-rc.4..origin/main; git diff --name-status v1.0.0-rc.4..origin/main"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"cat .git/nexus-claims/RELEASE_PUBLISHER/owner.json; git log --oneline --decorate v1.0.0-rc.4..origin/main; git diff --stat v1.0.0-rc.4..origin/main; git diff --name-status v1.0.0-rc.4..origin/main"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\n  \"agent\": \"/root\",\n  \"host\": \"mike-dev\",\n  \"branch\": \"v1/rc5-version-sync\",\n  \"worktree\": \"/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc5-version-sync\",\n  \"base\": \"016bbc332d694b32072f6346e7f3127fb98b691f\",\n  \"since\": \"2026-10-23T08:21:16Z\",\n  \"scope\": \"Release coordination and versioning/RC lifecycle preparation; preserve exact-source, installed-RC, independent and human acceptance gates.\",\n  \"status\": \"PR #212 RC5 notes merged at 05994a4; PR #213 and release-note update #214 merged, followed by PR #215 T4 source work at main ae69fe03. Main CodeQL40184831809 SUCCESS; CI40184831801 exact ae69fe03 has Node22/24 SUCCESS and Linux packaging step active (CLI tests completed). RC4 remains latest public release. No RC5 tag, installed-RC qualification, final human acceptance, or stable publication. Issue #1 custody unanswered; #2 M5 runs, #3 terminal matrix 0/15, #5 RC reproducibility, and #49 hardened evaluator/host acceptance remain open. This claim remains release coordination only; no held-out data accessed.\",\n  \"head\": \"8b7c09c76bf4e1c67794bdb9941bb50a0121b81b\",\n