d source gates pass; use scripts/sync-version.mjs as the sole writer; no tag or publication until prerequisite gates pass.\",\n  \"status\": \"exact origin/main 41b381d; requirements and rc.4 version checks pass; CodeQL40112589341 SUCCESS; CI40112589339 active in Node22/24 CLI tests; no version files edited\"\n}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":28648}},"started_at_ms":1792926550564,"completed_at_ms":1792926550564}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T11:09:11.547Z","ordinal":337017,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a172c0-0dfa-7590-a318-c8881a6f148d","call_id":"call_ca920d9a8fc7436f92290bc2a010eeca","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 2.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"## v1/rc5-version-sync...origin/v1/rc5-version-sync [ahead 24]\nae69fe03b935006ccda12b7a28f49f610d064617\nae69fe03b935006ccda12b7a28f49f610d064617\nae69fe0 Merge pull request #215 from mikeholownych/v1/plan-10-pr10c-t4-qualification\nc8d374a fix(eval): avoid post-close containment cleanup hang\n1b43e5a fix(eval): provide supervisor control pipe to preflight\n36e7865 test(eval): bind T4 fixture evidence to runner receipts\n7c9393c test(eval): require evidenced SIGTERM resume recovery\n5968795 Merge pull request #214 from mikeholownych/v1/rc5-notes-after-pr213\n1e11423 docs(release): note Git candidate state exclusion\n9398ffa Merge pull request #213 from mikeholownych/v1/defect-git-exclude-fail-closed-current-main-016bbc3\nae69fe03b935006ccda12b7a28f49f610d064617\n# Nexus Code v1.0.0-rc.5 release candidate\n\n**Maturity:** release candidate; prerelease, not stable.\n\n**Status:** this candidate is for exact-artifact qualification. It does not establish independent acceptance or authorize stable v1.0.0 promotion. Qualification results must identify the workflow-produced package and its digest.\n\nThis release packages the Nexus Code Linux x86-64 client: the TypeScript CLI and sidecar, production Node dependencies, Rust `harness-core`, and Ratatui `nexus-tui`.\n\n## Changes since RC4\n\n- An explicit `--read-only` launch cannot be lowered to `auto` during the session. Folder trust only enables project instructions and integrations; an unset approval mode defaults to review in every workspace.\n- Read-only REPL sessions refuse mutating slash commands such as `/init`, `/skill init`, `/commit`, `/upgrade`, and `/mcp add`. TUI `/test` follows verifier approval policy and can be cancelled with Escape.\n- Upgrade archive extraction uses a trusted system `tar` with ambient `TAR_OPTIONS` cleared, preventing PATH shims or environment options from executing during extraction.\n- RC reproducibility runs use the package builder from the reviewed workflow revision while keeping product source bound to the peeled RC tag, and verify the builder identity and bytes.\n- Upgrades fail closed when `NEXUS_VERIFY_ATTESTATION=1` and no trusted GitHub CLI is available. The installer now verifies provenance by default through `/usr/bin/gh` or `/usr/local/bin/gh`; setting `NEXUS_VERIFY_ATTESTATION=0` explicitly skips that check.\n- Corrects SSRF and locality classification for IPv6 NAT64 addresses. The well-known NAT64 prefix is checked against its embedded IPv4 destination, and the local-use NAT64 prefix is rejected.\n- Automated commits never include Nexus-managed `.nexus/` state, even when it was previously staged or ignore rules would expose it, including the first commit in a new repository.\n- Git-backed candidate identity also excludes `.nexus/` runtime state, so session and checkpoint writes do not appear as source progress or prevent stagnation detection.\n- Protects saved MCP server configuration that may contain credentials: the configuration directory and file use owner-only permissions, writes are atomic, and malformed or invalid existing configuration is preserved instead of being overwritten. Save failures are reported to the user.\n- Bounds `file_info` line counting to 8 MiB while retaining a fixed 1 KiB binary probe. Larger files still return metadata without full line-count scanning.\n- Caps CST symbol and outline reads at 8 MiB; workspace scans skip oversized files, while direct symbol and outline requests return an error. Parsing walks borrowed lines with a bounded nine-line signature lookahead, avoiding millions of per-line allocations on newline-dense files at the size limit.\n- Bounds `edit_file` and `patch_file` whole-file reads to the same 8 MiB limit. Oversized targets are left unchanged and receive a clear error.\n- Makes Linux package archives reproducible across supported build runners by creating them with the pinned release builder, removing host-specific archive metadata differences.\n- Corrects the cross-runner workflow's pinned artifact-download action so the exact published-candidate comparison can execute.\n\nThe REPL PTY cleanup change is test-harness reliability work and does not change product behavior. These source changes and their CI results do not replace RC5 artifact checks, cross-runner qualification, or installed-package qualification.\n\n## Runtime requirements\n\n- Linux x86-64 with glibc 2.35 or newer.\n- Node.js 22 or newer.\n- An OpenAI-compatible inference endpoint, local or explicitly selected provider.\n\nThe archive does not include Node.js. Rust and Cargo are not required at runtime. No other OS or architecture is claimed.\n\n## Candidate assets\n\nThe release workflow for `v1.0.0-rc.5` is expected to produce the version-matched Linux archive, `SHA256SUMS`, SBOM, notices, installer, and provenance. The workflow run, tag commit, artifact digests, and qualification evidence must be recorded before this candidate can be accepted. Local builds are not interchangeable with the workflow-produced artifacts.\n\n.git/nexus-claims/FILE_cli_package-lock.json/owner.json\n{\n  \"agent\": \"codex-root\",\n  \"host\": \"mike-dev\",\n  \"branch\": \"v1/rc5-version-sync\",\n  \"worktree\": \"/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc5-version-sync\",\n  \"base\": \"41b381ddac182b7f0c783b33df5f1355518f465b\",\n  \"since\": \"2026-10-24T16:24:12Z\",\n  \"pid\": 3779282,\n  \"scope\": \"Prepare the version-only v1.0.0-rc.5 transition after exact merge-SHA main CI and source gates pass; use scripts/sync-version.mjs as the sole writer; no tag or publication until prerequisite gates pass.\",\n  \"status\": \"exact origin/main 41b381d; requirements and rc.4 version checks pass; CodeQL40112589341 SUCCESS; CI40112589339 active in Node22/24 CLI tests; no version files edited\"\n}\n\n.git/nexus-claims/FILE_cli_package.json/owner.json\n{\n  \"agent\": \"codex-root\",\n  \"host\": \"mike-dev\",\n  \"branch\": \"v1/rc5-version-sync\",\n  \"worktree\": \"/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc5-version-sync\",\n  \"base\": \"41b381ddac182b7f0c783b33df5f1355518f465b\",\n  \"since\": \"2026-10-24T16:24:12Z\",\n  \"pid\": 3779282,\n  \"scope\": \"Prepare the version-only v1.0.0-rc.5 transition after exact merge-SHA main CI and source gates pass; use scripts/sync-version.mjs as the sole writer; no tag or publication until prerequisite gates pass.\",\n  \"status\": \"exact origin/main 41b381d; requirements and rc.4 version checks pass; CodeQL40112589341 SUCCESS; CI40112589339 active in Node22/24 CLI tests; no version files edited\"\n}\n\n.git/nexus-claims/FILE_core_Cargo.lock/owner.json\n{\n  \"agent\": \"codex-root\",\n  \"host\": \"mike-dev\",\n  \"branch\": \"v1/rc5-version-sync\",\n  \"worktree\": \"/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc5-version-sync\",\n  \"base\": \"41b381ddac182b7f0c783b33df5f1355518f465b\",\n  \"since\": \"2026-10-24T16:24:12Z\",\n  \"pid\": 3779282,\n  \"scope\": \"Prepare the version-only v1.0.0-rc.5 transition after exact merge-SHA main CI and source gates pass; use scripts/sync-version.mjs as the sole writer; no tag or publication until prerequisite gates pass.\",\n  \"status\": \"exact origin/main 41b381d; requirements and rc.4 version checks pass; CodeQL40112589341 SUCCESS; CI40112589339 active in Node22/24 CLI tests; no version files edited\"\n}\n\n.git/nexus-claims/FILE_core_Cargo.toml/owner.json\n{\n  \"agent\": \"codex-root\",\n  \"host\": \"mike-dev\",\n  \"branch\": \"v1/rc5-version-sync\",\n  \"worktree\": \"/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc5-version-sync\",\n  \"base\": \"41b381ddac182b7f0c783b33df5f1355518f465b\",\n  \"since\": \"2026-10-24T16:24:12Z\",\n  \"pid\": 3779282,\n  \"scope\": \"Prepare the version-only v1.0.0-rc.5 transition after exact merge-SHA main CI and source gates pass; use scripts/sync-version.mjs as the sole writer; no tag or publication until prerequisite gates pass.\",\n  \"status\": \"exact origin/main 41b381d; requirements and rc.4 version checks pass; CodeQL40112589341 SUCCESS; CI40112589339 active in Node22/24 CLI tests; no version files edited\"\n}\n\n.git/nexus-claims/FILE_package.json/owner.json\n{\n  \"agent\": \"codex-root\",\n  \"host\": \"mike-dev\",\n  \"branch\": \"v1/rc5-version-sync\",\n  \"worktree\": \"/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc5-version-sync\",\n  \"base\": \"41b381ddac182b7f0c783b33df5f1355518f465b\",\n  \"since\": \"2026-10-24T16:24:12Z\",\n  \"pid\": 3779282,\n  \"scope\": \"Prepare the version-only v1.0.0-rc.5 transition after exact merge-SHA main CI and source gates pass; use scripts/sync-version.mjs as the sole writer; no tag or publication until prerequisite gates pass.\",\n  \"status\": \"exact origin/main 41b381d; requirements and rc.4 version checks pass; CodeQL40112589341 SUCCESS; CI40112589339 active in Node22/24 CLI tests; no version files edited\"\n}\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17267-b4a8-7073-9d2a-32da76e0ee35","create_time":1792926551.5468915}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
