{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T11:09:48.502Z","ordinal":337043,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016adde37b766481a099b7ffd38985181a","status":"completed","call_id":"call_6efa709fa76d4e7c89fe5cf367b06fbc","name":"exec","input":"const p = await tools.apply_patch(\"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: ../nexus-wt/rc5-version-sync/docs/releases/v1.0.0-rc.5.md\\n@@\\n-The REPL PTY cleanup change is test-harness reliability work and does not change product behavior. These source changes and their CI results do not replace RC5 artifact checks, cross-runner qualification, or installed-package qualification.\\n+The REPL PTY cleanup and T4 evaluator supervisor changes improve qualification-harness reliability and do not change product behavior. In particular, containment cleanup after a task process exits no longer leaves a repeating timer behind. These source changes and their CI results do not replace RC5 artifact checks, cross-runner qualification, or installed-package qualification.\\n*** End Patch\");\ntext(p)\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17267-b4a8-7073-9d2a-32da76e0ee35","create_time":1792926587.464296}}}
