{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T11:11:55.419Z","ordinal":337156,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016adde3f9183881a080d6d1877e5f28bd","status":"completed","call_id":"call_ef4e8341221b45868c9047df0e6c7c08","name":"exec","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc5-version-sync push -u origin v1/rc5-version-bump && gh pr create --base main --head v1/rc5-version-bump --title \\\"release: prepare version-matched v1.0.0-rc.5 candidate\\\" --body \\\"## Summary\\n\\n- Synchronize root, CLI, and Rust package metadata to `1.0.0-rc.5` using `scripts/sync-version.mjs`.\\n- Clarify that PR #215's T4 supervisor and cleanup work improves qualification-harness reliability and does not change product behavior.\\n- Keep RC artifact construction gated on this exact candidate's checks; this PR does not tag or publish an RC and does not claim product qualification or acceptance.\\n\\n## Validation\\n\\n- `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check --tag v1.0.0-rc.5`: passed.\\n- `cli/test/version_only_diff.test.ts`: passed, 1/1.\\n- `git diff --check`: passed.\\n- Base `ae69fe03b935006ccda12b7a28f49f610d064617` exact-main CI and CodeQL: passed; requirements `--enforce`: passed with 12 exact-RC qualifications deferred.\\n\\nExact-head CI and review are required before merge. No RC tag or release was created.\\\"\",\"workdir\":\"/home/mike/nexus-code\",\"yield_time_ms\":10000,\"max_output_tokens\":1200});\ntext(r.output)\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17267-b4a8-7073-9d2a-32da76e0ee35","create_time":1792926713.0963116}}}
