{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T11:13:25.059Z","ordinal":337213,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a172c3-ec43-7313-aeb0-8c04d9dc815c","author":"/root/current_main_rc_path_audit","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/current_main_rc_path_audit\nPayload:\n**ACCEPT.** The root, CLI, lockfile, and Cargo versions are synchronized at `1.0.0-rc.5`. The release workflow requires a matching tag, synchronized versions, a tag on `main`, and a matching release note before producing artifacts. The PR #215 clarification accurately describes evaluator-harness changes and does not claim product qualification or acceptance; the notes keep RC5 qualification pending.\n\nRead-only review; no tests were run."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17267-b4a8-7073-9d2a-32da76e0ee35","create_time":1792926805.05944}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":16815}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T11:13:28.229Z","ordinal":337214,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17267-b4a8-7073-9d2a-32da76e0ee35","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adde4571b7c81a0b8fdf398dd156d94","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The claude-mem memory capture pause is still active because weekly Claude usage reached 99%; that is a quota-preservation pause, not provider exhaustion. I’ll continue the release work and won’t restart it or switch providers to bypass the pause.\n\nPR #216 has an independent `ACCEPT` review. I’m refreshing its exact-head CI now; the RC5 tag remains gated on those checks and the post-merge release gates."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1792926807148,"completed_at_ms":1792926808228}}
