{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T11:58:44.399Z","ordinal":337949,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17267-b4a8-7073-9d2a-32da76e0ee35","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-27138f8f-004d-4078-8046-a1597eeb2825","process_id":"42011","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh pr view 207 --json number,title,state,headRefName,headRefOid,baseRefName,baseRefOid,isDraft,mergeStateStatus,statusCheckRollup,body,url,files,reviewDecision && gh issue view 1 --json updatedAt,comments --jq '{updatedAt,comments:[.comments[-3:][]|{author:.author.login,createdAt,body}]}'"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh pr view 207 --json number,title,state,headRefName,headRefOid,baseRefName,baseRefOid,isDraft,mergeStateStatus,statusCheckRollup,body,url,files,reviewDecision && gh issue view 1 --json updatedAt,comments --jq '{updatedAt,comments:[.comments[-3:][]|{author:.author.login,createdAt,body}]}'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\"baseRefName\":\"main\",\"baseRefOid\":\"19b30a4c92b8dd2c891c5b7a5b67db319ee9ee7f\",\"body\":\"## Summary\\n\\nFail closed when Nexus cannot verify that its state exclusions are safely installed. The fix covers linked and nested worktrees, repository ignore precedence, safe `.nexus/` self-ignoring, verified `info/exclude` updates, and filesystem race-safe cleanup.\\n\\nThis is the no-force current-main continuation of the PR #200 work, kept on existing PR #207. Candidate `fb36b03c2ad9a22f4e94139accccee1d2f137ae3` has `main` at `016bbc332d694b32072f6346e7f3127fb98b691f` as an ancestor. Its tree is identical to reviewed candidate `7a5d4dcc3d35c68caf8a93a3bdeb2d7141101153`; the six-file source diff SHA-256 remains `55b0230bcdb125cecc263c83afbb83dc9bc54cab24ca557209a92f57d503de7a`.\\n\\n## Validation\\n\\n- `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce`: passed on candidate `7a5d4dc` with isolated HOME/XDG (123 rows; 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 exact-RC deferrals).\\n- Independent review: ACCEPT for the exact six-file diff SHA above. The ancestry-only merge changed no tree content.\\n- `git diff --check`: passed.\\n- Exact-head CI run `40169192095` and CodeQL run `40169192156` are running on `fb36b03`.\\n- Current local full-suite execution is owned by another agent and remains active. Exact-head local targeted/full tests have not yet run; no local test result is claimed here.\\n\\nThe previous PR #200 remains open to preserve its history. No installed-RC qualification or release acceptance is claimed by this PR.\\n\",\"files\":[{\"path\":\"cli/src/core/git_exclude.ts\",\"additions\":264,\"deletions\":39,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"cli/src/safe_fs.ts\",\"additions\":12,\"deletions\":29,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"cli/src/slash/catalog.ts\",\"additions\":1,\"deletions\":1,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"cli/src/slash/workspace_commands.ts\",\"additions\":36,\"deletions\":7,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"cli/src/upgrade.ts\",\"additions\":20,\"deletions\":6,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"cli/src/worktree.ts\",\"additions\":7,\"deletions\":2,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"cli/test/doctor.test.ts\",\"additions\":93,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"cli/test/flight_exclude.test.ts\",\"additions\":104,\"deletions\":1,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"cli/test/git_exclude.test.ts\",\"additions\":221,\"deletions\":2,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"cli/test/helpers/startup_permission_driver.py\",\"additions\":133,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"ADDED\"},{\"path\":\"cli/test/repl_approval_e2e.test.ts\",\"additions\":199,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"cli/test/upgrade_acceptance.test.ts\",\"additions\":73,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/sec101-119-pty-20261025.md\"