he provided value\n131:      --source-ref string            Enforce that the git ref associated with the source repository matches the provided value\n132:  -t, --template string              Format JSON output using a Go template; see \"gh help formatting\"\n133-\n134-INHERITED FLAGS\n--\n136-\n137-EXAMPLES\n138:  # Verify an artifact linked with a repository\n139:  $ gh attestation verify example.bin --repo github/example\n140-  \n141:  # Verify an artifact linked with an organization\n142:  $ gh attestation verify example.bin --owner github\n143-  \n144:  # Verify an artifact and output the full verification result\n145:  $ gh attestation verify example.bin --owner github --format json\n146-  \n147:  # Verify an OCI image using attestations stored on disk\n148:  $ gh attestation verify oci://<image-uri> --owner github --bundle sha256:foo.jsonl\n149-  \n150:  # Verify an artifact signed with a reusable workflow\n151:  $ gh attestation verify example.bin --owner github --signer-repo actions/example\n152-\n153-LEARN MORE\n154:  Use `gh <command> <subcommand> --help` for more information about a command.\n155-  Read the manual at https://cli.github.com/manual\n156-  Learn about exit codes using `gh help exit-codes`\ngh version 2.100.0 (2026-09-03)\nhttps://github.com/cli/cli/releases/tag/v2.100.0\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17267-b4a8-7073-9d2a-32da76e0ee35","create_time":1792933210.4382725}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
