ae69fe03. Current main CodeQL passed; CI Node22/24 passed and Linux package step is active. RC4 remains latest; no RC5, installed qualification, human acceptance or v1.0.0 publication. Open gates #1/#2/#3/#5/#49 remain. Claim scope remains coordination/versioning; held-out data untouched.\n2026-10-25T11:10:33Z /root RC5_BRANCH_RECOVERY: Recovered existing uncommitted package.json 1.0.0-rc.5 change and separate FILE_docs_releases_v1.0.0-rc.5.md change after the stale PID was confirmed absent. Docs delta accurately describes merged PR215 evaluator cleanup; preserved and left uncommitted outside the version-only commit. Updated all owned package/version, release-publisher and RC5-notes claims to branch v1/rc5-version-bump in the same worktree. No unknown changes overwritten.\n2026-10-25T11:12:40Z /root RC5_VERSION_CANDIDATE_PR216: Exact candidate de5f3435656c5652339f021ad94c3fa4129b3080 is pushed on v1/rc5-version-bump and PR #216 is OPEN against ae69fe03. Diff: synchronized 1.0.0-rc.5 metadata plus the separately claimed PR215 RC5-note clarification. Exact version sync check --tag v1.0.0-rc.5 PASS; requirements --enforce PASS (123 rows; 12 exact-RC deferrals); diff-check PASS. Exact PR CI Node22/24 and JS/TS pending; CodeRabbit skipped manual review; independent review not yet recorded. No tag/publication.\n2026-10-25T11:14:30Z /root REVIEW_ACCEPT PR216 exact_head=de5f3435656c5652339f021ad94c3fa4129b3080 base=ae69fe03 reviewer=rc5_candidate_review disposition=ACCEPT diff_sha256=dd9c5691dc8163e90bdf01054d6515a8b0c93ef38ebbf62b99866ec236431452 scope=version-only RC5 metadata and release-note accuracy; content review only, no tests or product qualification.\n2026-10-25T11:17:31Z /root CLAIM_STATUS_PR216: Updated owned RC5 publisher and version/file claims to record PR216 exact-head review ACCEPT and current checks. Node22/24 remain active on the exact candidate; no tag or publication.\n2026-10-25T11:53:38Z RELEASE FILE_package.json: merged via PR #216 at 405f5b96e20b9885