de/pull/104\"},{\"baseRefName\":\"main\",\"headRefName\":\"dependabot/github_actions/actions/REDACTED\",\"number\":103,\"title\":\"build(deps): bump actions/attest-build-provenance from 92c65d2898f1f53cfdc910b962cecff86e7f8fcc to ef244123eb79f2f7a7e75d99086184180e6d0018\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-21T16:06:47Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/103\"}]\n{\"comments\":[{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Metadata-only custody checkpoint from the release coordinator. I found no current held-out author/custodian claim in the shared claim ledger; the last public custodian response request was October 23 10:23 UTC. Please reply only with safe status metadata: (1) current independent author and custodian, including the acknowledged claim/handoff; (2) whether the 40-task corpus and setup/reference validation are complete; (3) whether the legacy runner-format incompatibility has a custodian-approved immutable resolution; and (4) whether access separation, digests, independence, and custody have been accepted. If the current custodian is unavailable, please state that explicitly and identify the authorized handoff needed. Do not post task payloads, answers, validators, author logs, credentials, or private digests. Qualification remains closed until independent custody acceptance.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-24T00:19:17Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Metadata-only custody status request: please confirm the current author/custodian owner and progress toward the 40-task corpus, including coverage/validation counts, setup and reference-validation status, private digest re-derivation, store and parent access controls, exposure-history review, immutable seal status, and expected custody acceptance. Please do not post task prompts, answers, validators, or other protected payloads here. Held-out qualification remains blocked until the independent custodian verifies completeness, coverage, integrity, and execution-boundary separation.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-24T02:16:57Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Release convergence update (public metadata only): post-merge CI and CodeQL now pass on current main `4e7297f545538e6422ca3890334a7036f58287ca` (CI run `40156576300`, CodeQL run `40156576296`). RC4 remains the newest prerelease; no stable release or final-candidate qualification has been established. The terminal matrix remains 0/15, T4 has not run, and the reproducibility workflow has not run on an RC. The metadata-only custody request from 2026-10-24 02:16 UTC remains unanswered.\\n\\nPlease reply to that request with the current custodian/owner, status and expected timing for independent custody acceptance, and whether a lossless compatibility path or replacement corpus is planned for the current evaluator contract. Please keep the reply to public metadata; do not post prompts, answers, validators, or protected task content. No held-out payload has been accessed by this implementation lane.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-25T03:55:09Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Follow-up for the current release candidate path (public metadata only): the current evaluator requires the blackbox-v1 task contract, while prior custody records describe the sealed legacy hidden-command corpus. Please confirm the currently assigned custodian, whether the sealed 40-task corpus can be qualified losslessly under the current evaluator or requires a newly versioned corpus, and the expected timing for the required custody acceptance and frozen run metadata. Please do not post task objectives, source payloads, validators, reference solutions, hidden results, or credentials here. No held-out execution has started.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-25T06:51:23Z\"}],\"number\":1,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"PLAN-10 task 8: finish and seal the held-out T2/T3 corpus\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-25T06:51:23Z\"}\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Saved to \\\"nexus-v1-release\\\" in nexus-code. Still open in it:\\n- ...114 more lines; read them with work_state_read\"}]}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17267-b4a8-7073-9d2a-32da76e0ee35","create_time":1792933770.8325999}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
