{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T13:09:43.905Z","ordinal":339310,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17267-b4a8-7073-9d2a-32da76e0ee35","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016addff975e3081a0987831e74b393f78","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The release remains active, but the main acceptance gates are still held-out custody and human terminal evidence. I’m checking the RC’s scripted installed-package scenarios next, which can advance without touching private corpus material or the Ubuntu installer boundary. The live OpenRouter engineering task needs a user-visible tool approval under the chosen review default, so I’m preparing its isolated fixture and approval step rather than silently switching to auto mode."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1792933783406,"completed_at_ms":1792933783905}}
