s Ubuntu22/24, Debian12, Fedora40 on Node22/24 plus expected noNode/Node20 failures across all four. One Ubuntu22/Node22 lifecycle cell passes alpha2 upgrade, repair, rollback, uninstall with synthetic state. Exact-current-source host preflight passes 10/10 using synthetic canary only. Cross-runner reproducibility run 40195749685: both builds successful, compare queued. Full E2 lifecycle matrix, M5/held-out custody, manual terminal acceptance, independent product and required human acceptance remain open; stable v1.0.0 not created.\",\n  \"head\": \"405f5b96e20b988523b99c8907d29b73bcd2a8fd\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-25T13:17:49Z\"\n}\n{\"agent\":\"/root/sandbox_argv_takeover\",\"branch\":\"v1/sec-demo-git-cleanup-race\",\"head\":\"bda4408ad50c4f57aaf7b8fa20b5711642ad19ef\",\"host\":null,\"scope\":\"diagnose and fix asynchronous Git-process cleanup race in demo/test/substrate-adapter.test.mjs; do not run tests until SUITE release; no retries or weakened expectations\",\"since\":\"2026-10-20T04:35:01Z\",\"worktree\":\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/sec-demo-git-cleanup-race\",\"status\":null}\n{\"agent\":\"codex-root\",\"branch\":\"v1/rc3-cross-runner-repro\",\"head\":\"ed36e70c7887917195ab2970e704b141aaeb2f12\",\"host\":\"mike-dev\",\"scope\":\"Implement exact published-RC cross-runner reproducibility and pin package-generation tools whose unpinned npx resolution could make its outputs non-reproducible; changes limited to the new repro workflow and the package/SBOM scripts; no suites while main CI is active\",\"since\":\"2026-10-24T01:40:00Z\",\"worktree\":\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc3-cross-runner-repro\",\"status\":\"PR_OPEN_WAITING_EXACT_HEAD_CHECKS\"}\n{\"agent\":\"codex-root\",\"branch\":\"v1/plan-09-packaging-tar-repro\",\"head\":\"f7747fada2ca9afd636bc41bac0f8f9a8b888487\",\"host\":\"mike-dev\",\"scope\":\"Investigate and fix cross-runner tar metadata differences in scripts/package-linux.sh using the approved digest-pinned build toolchain; preserve exact artifact checks