on and complete durable state restored from a recognized private backup directory (`backup.json`, `state/`, optional `config/`), with strict 0600 file / 0700 directory modes. A canonical `config.env.bak.*` path restores configuration only. Arbitrary files and tar archives are rejected. Run it through the stable `nexus` launcher; close existing legacy clients, then keep version-pinned legacy binaries and direct old entry points offline until the durable restore journal is cleared. |\n| Incompatible downgrade | `nexus upgrade --version <v> --allow-downgrade` (incompatible state schema) | Refused fail-closed with actionable state schema explanation. Existing installation unchanged. |\n\n## 8. Independent acceptance (REQ-AGT-110, ACC-CONT-10)\n\nThe reviewer is supplied by the owner (X5) and did not implement the work under review.\n\nThe reviewer receives:\nfind: ‘/var/tmp/nexus-rc5-verify.JLE1HN/heldout-synthetic-only’: Permission denied\nrc5-verification-summary.json\ndownload/compatibility.json\ndownload/sbom.json\ndownload/sbom.cdx.json\nhost-preflight-405f5b9.json\nrelease.json\nattestation-tarball.json\nattestation-checksums.json\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17267-b4a8-7073-9d2a-32da76e0ee35","create_time":1792934408.708902}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
