{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T13:21:30.412Z","ordinal":339902,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17267-b4a8-7073-9d2a-32da76e0ee35","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-8066a5b5-2fd8-46c9-9179-0d5d8f54a62a","process_id":"38340","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","for n in 1 3 5 49; do gh issue view \"$n\" --json number,title,updatedAt,comments --jq '{number,title,updatedAt,last:(.comments|map({createdAt,author:.author.login,body})|.[-1])}'; done; gh run view 40195749685 --json status,conclusion --jq '{status,conclusion}'"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"for n in 1 3 5 49; do gh issue view \"$n\" --json number,title,updatedAt,comments --jq '{number,title,updatedAt,last:(.comments|map({createdAt,author:.author.login,body})|.[-1])}'; done; gh run view 40195749685 --json status,conclusion --jq '{status,conclusion}'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\"last\":{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Follow-up for the current release candidate path (public metadata only): the current evaluator requires the blackbox-v1 task contract, while prior custody records describe the sealed legacy hidden-command corpus. Please confirm the currently assigned custodian, whether the sealed 40-task corpus can be qualified losslessly under the current evaluator or requires a newly versioned corpus, and the expected timing for the required custody acceptance and frozen run metadata. Please do not post task objectives, source payloads, validators, reference solutions, hidden results, or credentials here. No held-out execution has started.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-25T06:51:23Z\"},\"number\":1,\"title\":\"PLAN-10 task 8: finish and seal the held-out T2/T3 corpus\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-25T06:51:23Z\"}\n{\"last\":{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"### Terminal host preflight update (2026-10-25; setup only)\\n\\nThe Ubuntu 26.04 GNOME host has all five required terminal applications installed: xterm 407, kitty 0.45.0, GNOME Terminal 3.58.0, tmux 3.6, and VS Code 1.143.1. I also installed GitHub CLI 2.103.2 from GitHub CLI's official signed APT repository after verifying its published key fingerprint; `/usr/bin/gh attestation verify` is available for the candidate installer's provenance check.\\n\\nThis is environment setup only. No current-source RC is installed, no terminal cell has run, and the manual matrix remains 0/15. Each cell still needs the exact candidate identity, interactive checks, and both required screenshots.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-25T05:02:41Z\"},\"number\":3,\"title\":\"PLAN-10 task 12: complete the real-terminal acceptance matrix\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-25T05:02:41Z\"}\n{\"last\":{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Status check at `6a16cb6` (claude-code): the workflow is integrated. `.github/workflows/repro.yml` plus `scripts/repro-identity.mjs` (PR #20) build on ubuntu-22.04 and 24.04 with fail-closed tag/commit/clean-tree/version identity. It has **not** run on an RC because no RC tag exists yet. REQ-REL-114 is still `RR`, correctly. Next action: once the RC is tagged, the release publisher (codex-api-root) runs repro.yml on the exact RC and attaches the run ID and artifact hashes here.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-18T17:34:28Z\"},\"number\":5,\"title\":\"PLAN-07 PR-7e: prove cross-runner release reproducibility\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-18T17:34:28Z\"}\n{\"last\":{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Release-path reconciliation (2026-10-22; public metadata and source only; no held-out contents accessed):\\n\\n- The issue's PR #33 status is historical. PR #33 is merged into `v1/integration` at `cf06128d035768d82207bf061153301b2c993f94`; that merge is an ancestor of current `main@a4a7edd9a17a0015abdf8135ecf3c1caac05560c`. PR #33's exact-head CI was green on its recorded PR head, but that historical run is not current-head qualification.\\n- PR #140's synthetic host-preflight report merged to `main` at `44ca13d58a262b5f89be459b47aefa50c2d61683`, an ancestor of current main. It records infrastructure fixtures only; it is not private-corpus custody or a held-out run. Current main CI run `39863828016` is still in progress (Node 20/22/24 passed; Linux CLI/package job running).\\n- The current evaluator contract explicitly rejects legacy `hidden.command` validators for qualification. The old held-out manifest therefore remains incompatible with the approved `blackbox-v1` qualification path unless the independent custodian creates and validates a compatible immutable successor. No task has been run.\\n- The latest metadata-only custodian request on issue #1 is from `2026-10-22T22:08:34Z`; no custodian response or accepted handoff is visible as of this update. The release remains gated on custodian-led compatibility/replacement, fresh custody acceptance, and the other independent qualification gates.\\n\\nIssue #49 stays open for these unresolved acceptance dependencies. No thresholds were changed and no private corpus material was accessed.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-22T22:47:13Z\"},\"number\":49,\"title\":\"PLAN-10 PR-10m: accept hardened evaluator boundary (PR #33) and qualification host before held-out runs\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-22T22:47:13Z\"}\n{\"conclusion\":\"\",\"status\":\"queued\"}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":3,"nanos":523096450}},"started_at_ms":1792934486888,"completed_at_ms":1792934490411}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T13:21:32.084Z","ordinal":339903,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a17339-37b3-7e11-8e79-dfc8de4804f9","call_id":"call_c4331864b0d244cdaff6f8de18519880","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 6.7 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"last\":{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Follow-up for the current release candidate path (public metadata only): the current evaluator requires the blackbox-v1 task contract, while prior custody records describe the sealed legacy hidden-command corpus. Please confirm the currently assigned custodian, whether the sealed 40-task corpus can be qualified losslessly under the current evaluator or requires a newly versioned corpus, and the expected timing for the required custody acceptance and frozen run metadata. Please do not post task objectives, source payloads, validators, reference solutions, hidden results, or credentials here. No held-out execution has started.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-25T06:51:23Z\"},\"number\":1,\"title\":\"PLAN-10 task 8: finish and seal the held-out T2/T3 corpus\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-25T06:51:23Z\"}\n{\"last\":{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"### Terminal host preflight update (2026-10-25; setup only)\\n\\nThe Ubuntu 26.04 GNOME host has all five required terminal applications installed: xterm 407, kitty 0.45.0, GNOME Terminal 3.58.0, tmux 3.6, and VS Code 1.143.1. I also installed GitHub CLI 2.103.2 from GitHub CLI's official signed APT repository after verifying its published key fingerprint; `/usr/bin/gh attestation verify` is available for the candidate installer's provenance check.\\n\\nThis is environment setup only. No current-source RC is installed, no terminal cell has run, and the manual matrix remains 0/15. Each cell still needs the exact candidate identity, interactive checks, and both required screenshots.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-25T05:02:41Z\"},\"number\":3,\"title\":\"PLAN-10 task 12: complete the real-terminal acceptance matrix\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-25T05:02:41Z\"}\n{\"last\":{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Status check at `6a16cb6` (claude-code): the workflow is integrated. `.github/workflows/repro.yml` plus `scripts/repro-identity.mjs` (PR #20) build on ubuntu-22.04 and 24.04 with fail-closed tag/commit/clean-tree/version identity. It has **not** run on an RC because no RC tag exists yet. REQ-REL-114 is still `RR`, correctly. Next action: once the RC is tagged, the release publisher (codex-api-root) runs repro.yml on the exact RC and attaches the run ID and artifact hashes here.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-18T17:34:28Z\"},\"number\":5,\"title\":\"PLAN-07 PR-7e: prove cross-runner release reproducibility\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-18T17:34:28Z\"}\n{\"last\":{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Release-path reconciliation (2026-10-22; public metadata and source only; no held-out contents accessed):\\n\\n- The issue's PR #33 status is historical. PR #33 is merged into `v1/integration` at `cf06128d035768d82207bf061153301b2c993f94`; that merge is an ancestor of current `main@a4a7edd9a17a0015abdf8135ecf3c1caac05560c`. PR #33's exact-head CI was green on its recorded PR head, but that historical run is not current-head qualification.\\n- PR #140's synthetic host-preflight report merged to `main` at `44ca13d58a262b5f89be459b47aefa50c2d61683`, an ancestor of current main. It records infrastructure fixtures only; it is not private-corpus custody or a held-out run. Current main CI run `39863828016` is still in progress (Node 20/22/24 passed; Linux CLI/package job running).\\n- The current evaluator contract explicitly rejects legacy `hidden.command` validators for qualification. The old held-out manifest therefore remains incompatible with the approved `blackbox-v1` qualification path unless the independent custodian creates and validates a compatible immutable successor. No task has been run.\\n- The latest metadata-only custodian request on issue #1 is from `2026-10-22T22:08:34Z`; no custodian response or accepted handoff is visible as of this update. The release remains gated on custodian-led compatibility/replacement, fresh custody acceptance, and the other independent qualification gates.\\n\\nIssue #49 stays open for these unresolved acceptance dependencies. No thresholds were changed and no private corpus material was accessed.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-22T22:47:13Z\"},\"number\":49,\"title\":\"PLAN-10 PR-10m: accept hardened evaluator boundary (PR #33) and qualification host before held-out runs\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-22T22:47:13Z\"}\n{\"conclusion\":\"\",\"status\":\"queued\"}\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17267-b4a8-7073-9d2a-32da76e0ee35","create_time":1792934492.0839715}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
