{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T13:27:02.403Z","ordinal":340150,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17267-b4a8-7073-9d2a-32da76e0ee35","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-48700e5b-797c-4c56-8665-4e273683afec","process_id":"92892","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","git status --short --branch; git log -1 --oneline; git diff -- docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md; git show --stat --oneline HEAD; sed -n '312,345p' docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md; gh pr view 232 --json state,headRefOid,baseRefName,mergeStateStatus,statusCheckRollup,url; gh run view 40195749685 --json conclusion,status,headSha,displayTitle,jobs;"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/rc5-readiness-checkpoint","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"git status --short --branch; git log -1 --oneline; git diff -- docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md; git show --stat --oneline HEAD; sed -n '312,345p' docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md; gh pr view 232 --json state,headRefOid,baseRefName,mergeStateStatus,statusCheckRollup,url; gh run view 40195749685 --json conclusion,status,headSha,displayTitle,jobs;"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"## v1/rc5-readiness-checkpoint...origin/v1/rc5-readiness-checkpoint\n31a7ba9 docs(release): add exact RC5 qualification checkpoint\n31a7ba9 docs(release): add exact RC5 qualification checkpoint\n docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md | 38 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n 1 file changed, 38 insertions(+)\n- Ubuntu/GNOME is reachable and has all five required terminal applications, but `gh auth status` there reports no GitHub login. The RC5 installer stopped before creating files; the version-scoped desktop install prefix is absent. The manual terminal matrix is **0/15**.\n\n### Provider, PTY and reproducibility evidence\n\n- On the exact installed RC5 package, OpenRouter pinned model `nvidia/nemotron-3-ultra-550b-a55b:free` and ChatGPT sign-in model `gpt-6-luna` each passed streamed completion and tool-call/result verification. No workspace content was involved. OpenRouter's required live small engineering task remains pending; the disposable synthetic task has a failing baseline and waits for the operator's folder-trust choice. Nexus remains in its default `review` approval mode; folder trust does not change approvals.\n- The installed-package startup PTY smoke reached the Nexus prompt under isolated HOME. This does not satisfy the §5.2 scripted PTY set or the §5.3 human matrix. An attempted legacy §5.2 driver was invalid: its checkout-layout paths and wait condition do not match the current RC startup/trust prompt; its mock gateway recorded zero requests. No product pass/fail was inferred.\n- Reproducibility workflow [40195749685](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40195749685) built successfully on Ubuntu 22.04 and 24.04 from the exact tag. The two builder identities and all six artifact hashes match, including the published archive. The reviewed comparator run locally over the workflow artifacts returned `REQ-REL-114 / ACC-SUP-08 PASS`, but the workflow's own `compare` job remains queued. Keep `REQ-REL-114` pending until that job completes.\n\n### Remaining qualification gates\n\n| Gate | State at RC5 | Next executable step / completion condition |\n|---|---|---|\n| T2/T3 held-out custody | Blocked. Issue #1 has no custodian reply; the public 40-task manifest does not establish private custody acceptance, and the legacy validator contract is incompatible with the current evaluator. No private payload was accessed or run. | Independent custodian confirms author/handoff, compatible immutable corpus or successor, validation, access separation, digests and custody acceptance; only then prepare and execute the approved runs. |\n| Evaluator resource/secret boundary | Synthetic current-source host preflight 10/10; no accepted qualification-host/custody result. | Complete independent host and custody acceptance before any held-out execution. |\n| Standalone profiles | Not run on the installed RC; T2 subset dependency remains unmet. | After custody and frozen configuration, execute §4.2 profiles and archive exact-artifact receipts. |\n| T4 and long-task T3 | Not run. T4 remains nine fault classes × five runs; T3 remains eight tasks × five runs. | Freeze approved workload/configurations and prerequisites, then run exact RC serially with independent scoring. |\n| Scripted installed-RC PTY (§5.2) | Not established; legacy driver invocation was invalid. | Use an RC-compatible driver or otherwise execute all listed scenarios against the installed package and mock gateway, with measured outcomes. |\n| Human terminal matrix (§5.3) | 0/15. No screenshots or per-cell operator verdicts. | Install exact RC on the desktop after GitHub CLI authentication; complete all five terminals × three sizes with two distinct screenshots per cell. |\n| Cross-runner `REQ-REL-114` | Builder artifacts match; official comparator job queued. | Wait for run 40195749685 `compare` to reach a terminal result and archive its workflow-generated evidence. |\n| Independent RC acceptance | Not performed. | Independent reviewer evaluates the exact candidate and all mandatory evidence after qualification gates pass. |\n| Stable v1.0.0 | Not created or published. | Follow the version-only stable promotion and publish only after accepted RC, G6, final artifact/install checks and release evidence are complete. |\n\nPublic metadata updates were added to issues [#3](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/3) and [#5](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/5). Publication authority remains granted but gated by acceptance; no additional authorization is requested here.\n{\"baseRefName\":\"main\",\"headRefOid\":\"31a7ba947036d5c0277185be2468bf271fa31a21\",\"mergeStateStatus\":\"BLOCKED\",\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"statusCheckRollup\":[{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"conclusion\":\"\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40197522392/job/121181473559\",\"name\":\"javascript-typescript\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-25T13:25:14Z\",\"status\":\"QUEUED\",\"workflowName\":\"CodeQL\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"conclusion\":\"\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40197522285/job/121181472974\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (22)\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-25T13:25:33Z\",\"status\":\"IN_PROGRESS\",\"workflowName\":\"CI\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"conclusion\":\"\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40197522285/job/121181472748\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (24)\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-25T13:25:15Z\",\"status\":\"IN_PROGRESS\",\"workflowName\":\"CI\"},{\"__typename\":\"StatusContext\",\"context\":\"CodeRabbit\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-25T13:25:20Z\",\"state\":\"SUCCESS\",\"targetUrl\":\"\"}],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/232\"}\n{\"conclusion\":\"failure\",\"displayTitle\":\"Cross-runner RC reproducibility\",\"headSha\":\"405f5b96e20b988523b99c8907d29b73bcd2a8fd\",\"jobs\":[{\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-25T13:02:04Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"databaseId\":121176089951,\"name\":\"resolve-tag\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-25T13:01:50Z\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"steps\":[{\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-25T13:01:52Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Set up job\",\"number\":1,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-25T13:01:51Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-25T13:01:52Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Require dispatch from main\",\"number\":2,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-25T13:01:52Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-25T13:01:55Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Run actions/checkout@11d5960a326750d5838078e36cf38b85af677262\",\"number\":3,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-25T13:01:52Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"20