{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T13:28:38.948Z","ordinal":340242,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a1733f-bb24-72a3-9b9a-0f6b344762bc","author":"/root/current_main_rc_path_audit","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/current_main_rc_path_audit\nPayload:\n**CHANGES_REQUIRED**\n\nAt [READINESS.md:318](/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc5-readiness-checkpoint/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:318), the statement that both runner builds match the published archive on “the six recorded artifact hashes” overstates run 40195749685. Its official compare failed on `sbom.cdx.json`; it did not reach the later `install.sh` comparison. Narrow the match claim to artifacts the logs show passed, and state that the SBOM differed and `install.sh` was not compared.\n\nThe checkpoint correctly records the failed compare and npm-version mismatch, keeps `REQ-REL-114` open, and leaves other qualification gates incomplete. It does not claim RC acceptance or stable release."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17267-b4a8-7073-9d2a-32da76e0ee35","create_time":1792934918.9481387}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":16962}}
