{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T13:28:44.176Z","ordinal":340245,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17267-b4a8-7073-9d2a-32da76e0ee35","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016ade040b8d1481a0bee6092707320e42","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The reviewer found one overbroad sentence in the checkpoint: the comparator stops at the SBOM mismatch, so it never compares `install.sh`. I’m narrowing the wording to the exact checks reached, then I’ll send the corrected document back for review."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1792934923583,"completed_at_ms":1792934924176}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T13:28:44.183Z","ordinal":340246,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","status":"completed","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016ade040b8d1481a0bee6092707320e42","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"The reviewer found one overbroad sentence in the checkpoint: the comparator stops at the SBOM mismatch, so it never compares `install.sh`. I’m narrowing the wording to the exact checks reached, then I’ll send the corrected document back for review.","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17267-b4a8-7073-9d2a-32da76e0ee35","create_time":1792934923.5528166,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016ade040b8d1481a0bee6092707320e42","turn_id":"01a17267-b4a8-7073-9d2a-32da76e0ee35","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a1733f-cf97-7ad3-9234-751d976c9796","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":16963}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T13:28:46.877Z","ordinal":340247,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016ade040c182c81a0be0e180d2fd121ac","status":"completed","call_id":"call_c91d2c6c41884326a1cf054161323f47","name":"exec","input":"const p = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc5-readiness-checkpoint/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\\n@@\\n-- Reproducibility workflow [40195749685](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40195749685) built successfully on Ubuntu 22.04 and 24.04 from the exact tag, but its official `compare` job **failed**. Both runner builds match each other and the published archive on the six recorded artifact hashes; the full comparison also checks the SBOM and found `metadata.tools` records npm `10.9.9` in the published RC versus npm `10.9.4` in both rebuilds. A local comparison of only the runner identity artifacts passed but did not establish `REQ-REL-114 / ACC-SUP-08`; the official result is authoritative. `REQ-REL-114` remains open until the toolchain is aligned, the release/rebuild evidence is regenerated as needed, and a new exact-RC comparison passes.\\n+- Reproducibility workflow [40195749685](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40195749685) built successfully on Ubuntu 22.04 and 24.04 from the exact tag, but its official `compare` job **failed**. The comparator's earlier archive and compatibility checks passed; it then found that `metadata.tools` records npm `10.9.9` in the published RC SBOM versus npm `10.9.4` in both rebuild SBOMs. Because it stopped at that mismatch, the later `install.sh` comparison was not reached. A local comparison of only the runner identity artifacts passed but did not establish `REQ-REL-114 / ACC-SUP-08`; the official result is authoritative. `REQ-REL-114` remains open until the toolchain is aligned, the release/rebuild evidence is regenerated as needed, and a new exact-RC comparison passes.\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(p));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17267-b4a8-7073-9d2a-32da76e0ee35","create_time":1792934924.0955942}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T13:28:46.908Z","ordinal":340248,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17267-b4a8-7073-9d2a-32da76e0ee35","item":{"type":"FileChange","id":"exec-6afb39ea-a82a-499e-9cdb-b527d130e554","changes":{"/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc5-readiness-checkpoint/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -317,3 +317,3 @@\n - The installed-package startup PTY smoke reached the Nexus prompt under isolated HOME. This does not satisfy the §5.2 scripted PTY set or the §5.3 human matrix. An attempted legacy §5.2 driver was invalid: its checkout-layout paths and wait condition do not match the current RC startup/trust prompt; its mock gateway recorded zero requests. No product pass/fail was inferred.\n-- Reproducibility workflow [40195749685](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40195749685) built successfully on Ubuntu 22.04 and 24.04 from the exact tag, but its official `compare` job **failed**. Both runner builds match each other and the published archive on the six recorded artifact hashes; the full comparison also checks the SBOM and found `metadata.tools` records npm `10.9.9` in the published RC versus npm `10.9.4` in both rebuilds. A local comparison of only the runner identity artifacts passed but did not establish `REQ-REL-114 / ACC-SUP-08`; the official result is authoritative. `REQ-REL-114` remains open until the toolchain is aligned, the release/rebuild evidence is regenerated as needed, and a new exact-RC comparison passes.\n+- Reproducibility workflow [40195749685](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40195749685) built successfully on Ubuntu 22.04 and 24.04 from the exact tag, but its official `compare` job **failed**. The comparator's earlier archive and compatibility checks passed; it then found that `metadata.tools` records npm `10.9.9` in the published RC SBOM versus npm `10.9.4` in both rebuild SBOMs. Because it stopped at that mismatch, the later `install.sh` comparison was not reached. A local comparison of only the runner identity artifacts passed but did not establish `REQ-REL-114 / ACC-SUP-08`; the official result is authoritative. `REQ-REL-114` remains open until the toolchain is aligned, the release/rebuild evidence is regenerated as needed, and a new exact-RC comparison passes.\n \n","move_path":null}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc5-readiness-checkpoint/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1792934926906,"completed_at_ms":1792934926908}}
