d ACCEPT; exact CI pending. Desktop public checksum verified, but gh attestation verify cannot run because desktop GitHub CLI is unauthenticated; did not bypass installer provenance verification. Acceptance remains IN_PROGRESS.\\\\n')\\nprint(now)\\nPY\\ncat /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/RELEASE_PUBLISHER/owner.json | tail -n 8; tail -n 3 /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims.log\",\"workdir\":\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc5-readiness-checkpoint\",\"yield_time_ms\":10000,\"max_output_tokens\":1500});\ntext(r.output)\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17267-b4a8-7073-9d2a-32da76e0ee35","create_time":1792935101.4495602}}}
