{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T13:50:54.342Z","ordinal":341020,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17267-b4a8-7073-9d2a-32da76e0ee35","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-b6a87209-1402-48b7-a9c4-ddf613f8ce7e","server":"mcp-search","tool":"work_state_read","arguments":{"list":"nexus-v1-release","includeClosed":false},"pluginId":"claude-mem@claude-mem-local","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"- nexus-v1-release: pr133_ci=Node20/22/24 and CodeQL passed exact head; Linux packaging run 39665020828 active, pr133_head=6f522952bb50d956f259068b0a34151f614c956a, next=Wait exact PR #233 CI. If all pass, integrate through protected PR path, verify post-merge gates, prepare and publish a new RC because RC5 is immutable, then rerun cross-runner exact artifact reproduction., current_main=main advanced to ae69fe03b935006ccda12b7a28f49f610d064617, merge of PR #215. PR #215 exact CI40182316462 and CodeQL40182316289 passed; independent review ACCEPT exact c8d374a. Post-merge CI40184831801 and CodeQL40184831809 are in progress., sbom=PR134 merged as 049880f; exact PR CI39679493728 all4 SUCCESS, CodeQL39679493753 SUCCESS, focused SBOM closure tests 10/10 PASS, independent ACCEPT; post-merge main gates pass, active_claims=Release publisher remains active; SUITE now released after exact main CI and CodeQL terminal success; no other local test started, blocking_decision=RC2 Node floor: awaiting user's choice between DEC-12 >=20 with EOL disclosure and newer reported no-EOL mandate >=22, pr126_status=Merged 2026-10-21T23:16:39Z as f8ba4c1248d400ac321aec1d08b74437a1c8d70b after exact-head CI run39688533586 all four success and CodeQL39688533646 success. Postmerge main CI39692357597 and CodeQL39692357575 in progress. PR127/128 old checks are stale because base ffad03f; must refresh/requalify serially. PR135 CI active on previous main 049880f; refresh after terminal., pr135_status=Exact head 771849b64cccb41ed4d9fb2c6e91458c36d3e34b CI39689926298 all four jobs SUCCESS and CodeQL39689926282 SUCCESS, but it is based on old main 049880f; main moved to f8ba4c after PR126. Refresh readiness claim to current main after postmerge CI39692357597/CodeQL39692357575 terminal and rerun exact-head checks., main_postmerge_CI=Run 40171717813 exact main 05994a4 still IN_PROGRESS; Node22 and Node24 CLI full suites running., main_postmerge_CodeQL=Run 40171717805 exact main 05994a4 SUCCESS., PR127=open; refreshed exact head f9d2743decd2dd3a4816f3bd8b5ec7f00d7a8801 based on ac8a97; normal push from remote head 0d87c00; independent review ACCEPT; exact CI39706694418 and 39706694528 running, CodeQL39706694522 SUCCESS; SUITE exclusive claim held, contest_freeze=none; user confirms contest has ended, release_status=Acceptance IN_PROGRESS; RC4 latest public prerelease; no stable v1.0.0. Held-out custody request remains unanswered; no protected qualification., current_main_CI=Exact main 05994a40c6e13bdaad9348fe62751220f7f53099 CI40171717813 and CodeQL40171717805 terminal SUCCESS., REDACTED SUCCESS exact main, release_blocker=exact-main behavioral CI failures on Node22 and Node24; awaiting workflow logs after terminal to identify cases and classify, PR128=candidate 8e114e2 based on 7952fac; independent review ACCEPT; no push/tests until main failure is triaged and exact main source suite passes, pr139=MERGED; exact PR CI39721786589 and CodeQL39721786428 PASS, independent ACCEPT; post-merge CI39725081299 and CodeQL39725081349 in progress, runtime_policy_conflict=Awaiting user choice: merged DEC-12 >=20 with EOL disclosure vs later relayed no-EOL-runtime mandate and draft PR137 >=22; do not alter runtime floor until resolved, pr128_head=8b585b5aa0223dcd2cd8f2bd90cb27c858dd66d3 pushed normal fast-forward after main CI; independent review ACCEPT; exact CI39728018027 running Node20/22/24; CodeQL39728018086 SUCCESS, suite_claim=KimiCode-defect-scan claims SUITE