{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T13:56:56.135Z","ordinal":341157,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17359-3515-7cd3-8706-e6bd2e3432cb","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-86789f5b-d027-49b1-b855-a4c0bfa574d6","process_id":"83022","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh issue view 3 --json number,state,title,updatedAt,comments | jq '{number,state,title,updatedAt,latest:(.comments[-3:]|map({author:.author.login,createdAt,body:(.body|.[0:1000])}))}'"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh issue view 3 --json number,state,title,updatedAt,comments | jq '{number,state,title,updatedAt,latest:(.comments[-3:]|map({author:.author.login,createdAt,body:(.body|.[0:1000])}))}'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\n  \"number\": 3,\n  \"state\": \"OPEN\",\n  \"title\": \"PLAN-10 task 12: complete the real-terminal acceptance matrix\",\n  \"updatedAt\": \"2026-10-25T13:40:58Z\",\n  \"latest\": [\n    {\n      \"author\": \"mikeholownych\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-25T13:23:04Z\",\n      \"body\": \"### RC5 terminal matrix preparation (2026-10-25; no cells run)\\n\\nThe exact candidate is public as `v1.0.0-rc.5`, source commit `405f5b96e20b988523b99c8907d29b73bcd2a8fd`, with published archive SHA-256 `b15c45f6ac7684ce8752b45432df30d77b3ecd4cc7c4ab9ee1afc8670eea8c19`. The official installer and provenance were verified on the authenticated engineering host.\\n\\nThe connected Ubuntu 26.04/GNOME desktop has all five required terminals installed. The RC5 installer check there stopped before creating files because `gh auth status` reports no GitHub login; the version-scoped install prefix is absent. After signing in with GitHub CLI on that desktop, use the documented RC5 installer with prefix `$HOME/.local/rc5-qual-405f5`, verify `nexus --version` is `1.0.0-rc.5 (405f5b96e20b)`, and use that installed binary for the matrix.\\n\\nThe matrix remains **0/15**. Run `scripts/terminal-acceptance/run-cell.sh` once for each of the five terminals (`xterm`, `kitty`, `tmux-gnome`, `vscode`, `gnome`) at 80×2\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"author\": \"mikeholownych\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-25T13:36:53Z\",\n      \"body\": \"### RC5 installer verification follow-up (2026-10-25; no cells run)\\n\\nOn the connected Ubuntu 26.04/GNOME desktop, the public RC5 archive downloads successfully and its SHA-256 matches the published `SHA256SUMS` entry (`b15c45f6ac7684ce8752b45432df30d77b3ecd4cc7c4ab9ee1afc8670eea8c19`). The installer’s required provenance verification remains unavailable because GitHub CLI is not signed in on that host (`gh attestation verify` requests `gh auth login`). I did not set `NEXUS_VERIFY_ATTESTATION=0` or create an installation. The version-scoped prefix remains absent; the terminal matrix is still 0/15.\\n\\nTo proceed with the official installer and preserve the provenance gate, sign in on that desktop using GitHub CLI, then rerun the documented installer command from the prior update.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"author\": \"mikeholownych\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-25T13:40:58Z\",\n      \"body\": \"### Candidate selection correction (2026-10-25)\\n\\nRC5 has now failed its official cross-runner comparison because the published SBOM and rebuild SBOMs record different npm versions. Do not treat terminal runs on RC5 as v1.0.0 acceptance evidence. Keep the matrix at **0/15** and retain the existing worksheet/setup notes; after the toolchain fix is integrated and the successor RC is built and published, install that exact successor with provenance verification and bind every cell and screenshot to its identity and digest.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":418366642}},"started_at_ms":1792936615716,"completed_at_ms":1792936616135}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T13:56:56.268Z","ordinal":341158,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17359-3515-7cd3-8706-e6bd2e3432cb","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-805f4681-5cd8-4246-b932-becc817aab7c","process_id":"79155","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh issue view 1 --json number,state,title,updatedAt,comments | jq '{number,state,title,updatedAt,latest:(.comments[-3:]|map({author:.author.login,createdAt,body:(.body|.[0:1000])}))}'"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh issue view 1 --json number,state,title,updatedAt,comments | jq '{number,state,title,updatedAt,latest:(.comments[-3:]|map({author:.author.login,createdAt,body:(.body|.[0:1000])}))}'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\n  \"number\": 1,\n  \"state\": \"OPEN\",\n  \"title\": \"PLAN-10 task 8: finish and seal the held-out T2/T3 corpus\",\n  \"updatedAt\": \"2026-10-25T06:51:23Z\",\n  \"latest\": [\n    {\n      \"author\": \"mikeholownych\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-24T02:16:57Z\",\n      \"body\": \"Metadata-only custody status request: please confirm the current author/custodian owner and progress toward the 40-task corpus, including coverage/validation counts, setup and reference-validation status, private digest re-derivation, store and parent access controls, exposure-history review, immutable seal status, and expected custody acceptance. Please do not post task prompts, answers, validators, or other protected payloads here. Held-out qualification remains blocked until the independent custodian verifies completeness, coverage, integrity, and execution-boundary separation.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"author\": \"mikeholownych\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-25T03:55:09Z\",\n      \"body\": \"Release convergence update (public metadata only): post-merge CI and CodeQL now pass on current main `4e7297f545538e6422ca3890334a7036f58287ca` (CI run `40156576300`, CodeQL run `40156576296`). RC4 remains the newest prerelease; no stable release or final-candidate qualification has been established. The terminal matrix remains 0/15, T4 has not run, and the reproducibility workflow has not run on an RC. The metadata-only custody request from 2026-10-24 02:16 UTC remains unanswered.\\n\\nPlease reply to that request with the current custodian/owner, status and expected timing for independent custody acceptance, and whether a lossless compatibility path or replacement corpus is planned for the current evaluator contract. Please keep the reply to public metadata; do not post prompts, answers, validators, or protected task content. No held-out payload has been accessed by this implementation lane.\\n\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"author\": \"mikeholownych\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-25T06:51:23Z\",\n      \"body\": \"Follow-up for the current release candidate path (public metadata only): the current evaluator requires the blackbox-v1 task contract, while prior custody records describe the sealed legacy hidden-command corpus. Please confirm the currently assigned custodian, whether the sealed 40-task corpus can be qualified losslessly under the current evaluator or requires a newly versioned corpus, and the expected timing for the required custody acceptance and frozen run metadata. Please do not post task objectives, source payloads, validators, reference solutions, hidden results, or credentials here. No held-out execution has started.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":569153230}},"started_at_ms":1792936615698,"completed_at_ms":1792936616268}}
