as not started. Enter a different instruction in the composer.\"\n              : \"This turn was cancelled before it started.\";\n            this.emit({ type: \"error\", id: turnId, code: \"INTERNAL\", message });\n            return;\n          }\n          if (choice === \"read_only\") {\n            agent.setCheckpointReadOnlyFallback(true);\n            this.emit({ type: \"notice\", text: \"Continuing this turn in read-only mode as requested. Workspace changes, unsafe commands, external actions, and delegation are disabled.\" });\n            this.emitSessionState();\n            checkpointReady = true;\n          } else if (choice === \"without_checkpoint\") {\n            this.emit({ type: \"notice\", text: \"Continuing in the current mode without a rollback checkpoint, as requested.\" });\n            checkpointReady = true;\n          } else if (choice === \"allow_sensitive…388 tokens truncated… id = `checkpoint-choice-${++this.approvalSeq}`;\n    return new Promise((resolve) => {\n      const settle = (choice: \"read_only\" | \"without_checkpoint\" | \"allow_sensitive\" | \"cancel\" | \"other\") => {\n        signal.removeEventListener(\"abort\", onAbort);\n        this.pendingCheckpointChoice = undefined;\n        resolve(choice);\n      };\n      const onAbort = () => settle(\"cancel\");\n      signal.addEventListener(\"abort\", onAbort, { once: true });\n      this.pendingCheckpointChoice = { id, settle };\n      this.emit({\n        type: \"checkpoint.choice.request\",\n        id,\n        turn_id: turnId,\n        message,\n      });\n    });\n  }\n\n  private resolveCheckpointChoice(id: string, choice: \"read_only\" | \"without_checkpoint\" | \"allow_sensitive\" | \"cancel\" | \"other\"): void {\n    const pending = this.pendingCheckpointChoice;\n    if (!pending || pending.id !== id) {\n      this.emit({ type: \"error\", id, code: \"NOT_FOUND\", message: `No pending checkpoint choice with id ${id}.` });\n      return;\n    }\n    pending.settle(choice);\n  }\n189:          const message = capText(redactSecrets(stripEscapes((err as Error).message ?? String(err))));\n240:      this.emit({ type: \"error\", id, code: \"INTERNAL\", message: capText(redactSecrets(String((err as Error).message ?? err))) });\n254:      this.emit({ type: \"provider.result\", id, provider, success, message: capText(redactSecrets(message)) });\n281:    this.emit({ type: \"steer.ack\", id, status, message, ...(text !== undefined ? { text: capText(text, 64_000) } : {}) });\n381:    for (const id of ids) this.emit({ type: \"slash.result\", id, command: \"compact\", success: ok, output: capText(redactSecrets(stripEscapes(message)), MAX_SLASH_OUTPUT) });\n439:    const toolName = (tool: string) => capText(redactSecrets(stripEscapes(tool)), 200);\n469:          ...(subject ? { subject: capText(redactSecrets(stripEscapes(subject)), 200) } : {}),\n482:          path: capText(visibleControls(redactSecrets(file)), 400),\n498:            ? `Requirements still open (${capText(redactSecrets(detail), 120)}): Nexus asked the agent to continue (${n} of ${max}).`\n551:            : `Checkpoint failed: ${capText(redactSecrets(errorText(err)).replace(/\\\\s+/g, \" \").trim(), 180)}. No checkpoint was written. Choose 1 read-only, 2 continue without a rollback checkpoint, 3 retry while allowing sensitive persistence, 4 cancel this turn, or 5 re-enter the instruction.`;\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17359-3515-7cd3-8706-e6bd2e3432cb","create_time":1792937693.1566544}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
