{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T14:15:04.912Z","ordinal":341764,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_01a1736a-3dd0-78a2-9a4d-f0f2e7c5d34a","role":"developer","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Current: 2026-10-25 2:15pm UTC\nThis file has prior observations — supplementary context follows. The Read result below is the full requested section.\n- **Need details on a past observation?** get_observations([IDs]) — ~300 tokens each.\n- **Need a structural map first?** smart_outline(\"cli/test/sidecar.test.ts\") — line numbers only, cheaper than re-reading.\n### Oct 4, 2026\n11907 4:05a 🟣 SidecarServer Test Suite: 5/5 Pass, Zero TypeScript Errors in nexus-code-tui-sidecar\n11776 4:11a 🟣 Full Sidecar Test Suite: 14/14 Pass Across All Describe Blocks — Cancellation and Slash Also Green\n11779 4:14a 🔵 Sidecar Integration Tests Run Red — hello Never Arrives Within 20 s Timeout\n11894 4:24a 🔵 CLI Sidecar Branch Commit Chain — 7 Commits, 1030 Insertions Across 10 Files\n12010 9:07a 🔵 Approval Protocol Wire Format Confirmed — approve/deny Commands Use req.id, always=true Stops Future Requests\n12492 11:30p 🔵 Phase 4 backlog from Phase 3C Task 2 review: receipt staleness, size, and redaction defects\n### Oct 5, 2026\n12807 8:13a 🔴 NEXUS_DEBUG=1 Stderr Redaction Test Failing — Key Reaches Stderr Unredacted\n13047 12:46p 🔴 Sidecar Fix Detail: row() Helper Guards Against Null Fields, Panel Errors Emit INTERNAL, /clear Nulls lastTurn\n### Oct 12, 2026\n16036 6:06a 🔵 Baseline Worktree Compatibility Check — New Tests Fail Against Old Code as Expected\n16079 6:37a 🟣 Group G Test Suite — Findings Durability, Recoverability, and Incomplete-Output Contracts\n16326 11:26a 🔵 Test Fixture Gateway Extended: Chunked Streaming and Body-Aware Script Callback\n### Oct 13, 2026\n17114 10:10p 🔵 Agent exposes requestCancel and getTurnLifecycle; sidecar tests use a withSidecar harness over a scripted gateway\n### Oct 19, 2026\n19705 2:44p 🔵 PR #61 owner confirmed post-recovery: codex-app-01a139bf-cont08 on mike-dev, diagnosing schema-2 fixture failures\n### Oct 20, 2026\n20301 2:54p 🔵 PR #83 Has Fault-Injection Tests and CI Near-Complete — Only linux-x86_64 Pending\n### Oct 21, 2026\n21307 9:09a 🔵 PLAN-04 Restore Safety Protocol Fully Implemented — All Handoff README \"NOT implemented\" Items Now Present"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17359-3515-7cd3-8706-e6bd2e3432cb","create_time":1792937704.9122472,"content_item_kinds":["hooks.additional_context"]}}}
