{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T14:20:22.457Z","ordinal":342032,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a1736f-1638-7e02-bab0-73f7764e5c6c","call_id":"call_873aea550c944d868c840336a9e4a1b8","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 5.9 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__deregister_agent\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nRemove an agent from a project. Marks the agent as inactive and removes it from the active roster. Messages from/to the agent are preserved for audit but the agent can no longer send or receive new messages.\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__deregister_agent(args: { agent_name: string; project_key: string; registration_token?: string | null; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>>; };\n```\n---\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__expire_window\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nMark a window identity as expired.\n\nParameters\n----------\nproject_key : str\n    Project identifier.\nwindow_uuid : str\n    The UUID of the window identity to expire.\n\nReturns\n-------\ndict\n    { window_uuid, expired: bool, expired_at }\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__expire_window(args: { format?: string | null; project_key: string; window_uuid: string; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>>; };\n```\n---\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_window_identities\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nList active window identities for a project.\n\nReturns all non-expired window identities with their display names,\nlast activity timestamps, and age.\n\nParameters\n----------\nproject_key : str\n    Project identifier.\n\nReturns\n-------\ndict\n    { identities: [{ id, window_uuid, display_name, created_ts, last_active_ts, expires_ts }] }\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_window_identities(args: { format?: string | null; project_key: string; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>>; };\n```\n---\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__register_agent\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nCreate or update an agent identity within a project and persist its profile to Git.\n\nWhen to use\n-----------\n- At the start of a coding session by any automated agent.\n- To update an existing agent's program/model/task metadata and bump last_active.\n\nSemantics\n---------\n- If `name` is omitted, a random adjective+noun name is auto-generated.\n- Reusing the same `name` updates the profile (program/model/task) and\n  refreshes `last_active_ts`.\n- A `profile.json` file is written under `agents/<Name>/` in the project archive.\n\nAgent Identity\n---------------\nTwo naming modes are supported:\n1. **Explicit identity** — pass a stable ID like ``alpha-one``, ``cc-0``,\n   or ``worker_42``.  Must match ``[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._-]{0,127}``.\n   Useful for swarm workflows where agents are relaunched onto the same\n   identity.\n2. **Auto-generated** — omit ``name`` to get a random adjective+noun\n   identity like ``GreenLake`` or ``Bl\n---\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__rename_window\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nUpdate the display name of a window identity.\n\nParameters\n----------\nproject_key : str\n    Project identifier.\nwindow_uuid : str\n    The UUID of the window identity to rename.\nnew_display_name : str\n    New display name (must be a valid adjective+noun agent name).\n\nReturns\n-------\ndict\n    Updated window identity record.\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__rename_window(args: { format?: string | null; new_display_name: string; project_key: string; window_uuid: string; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>>; };\n```\n---\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__request_contact\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nRequest contact approval to message another agent.\n\nCreates (or refreshes) a pending AgentLink and sends a small ack_required intro message.\n\nDiscovery\n---------\nTo discover available agent names, use: resource://agents/{project_key}\nAgent names are NOT the same as program names or user names.\n\nParameters\n----------\nproject_key : str\n    Project slug or human key.\nfrom_agent : str\n    Your agent name (must be registered in the project).\nto_agent : str\n    Target agent name (use resource://agents/{project_key} to discover names).\nto_project : Optional[str]\n    Target project if different from your project (cross-project coordination).\nreason : str\n    Optional explanation for the contact request.\nttl_seconds : int\n    Time to live for the contact approval request (default: 7 days).\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__request_contact(args: { format?: string | null; from_agent: s"},{"type":"input_text","text":"[{\"baseRefName\":\"main\",\"headRefName\":\"v1/attestation-auto-default\",\"headRefOid\":\"5bdd788eed2098913b2b68844757cc0e63282a6a\",\"number\":235,\"title\":\"fix(release): verify provenance when possible by default\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/235\"},{\"baseRefName\":\"main\",\"headRefName\":\"v1/rc6-version-bump\",\"headRefOid\":\"403d6de657542a50cdbcfe714751870835505888\",\"number\":234,\"title\":\"release: stage version-matched rc6 candidate\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/234\"},{\"baseRefName\":\"main\",\"headRefName\":\"v1/rc5-readiness-checkpoint\",\"headRefOid\":\"68e8320f8ecf54be0917f728a6f98c8d2424554b\",\"number\":232,\"title\":\"docs(release): add exact RC5 qualification checkpoint\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/232\"},{\"baseRefName\":\"main\",\"headRefName\":\"dependabot/npm_and_yarn/experiments/cloudflare-artifacts-vertical-slice/shared-ref-worker/cf-1.0.0-beta.20\",\"headRefOid\":\"343e3c78c4a406212b93bb31caebefb73ef58b5a\",\"number\":231,\"title\":\"build(deps-dev): bump cf from 1.0.0-beta.10 to 1.0.0-beta.20 in /experiments/cloudflare-artifacts-vertical-slice/shared-ref-worker\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/231\"},{\"baseRefName\":\"main\",\"headRefName\":\"dependabot/npm_and_yarn/experiments/cloudflare-artifacts-vertical-slice/agent-collab-worker/cloudflare/vite-plugin-2.0.0-beta.v.3\",\"headRefOid\":\"e4dd2dfc59970f103513e46b10ad58b69ef2e20e\",\"number\":230,\"title\":\"build(deps-dev): bump @cloudflare/vite-plugin from 2.0.0-beta.sha-52b0dc0e9 to 2.0.0-beta.v.3 in /experiments/cloudflare-artifacts-vertical-slice/agent-collab-worker\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/230\"},{\"baseRefName\":\"main\",\"headRefName\":\"dependabot/npm_and_yarn/experiments/cloudflare-artifacts-vertical-slice/fork-worker/cf-1.0.0-beta.20\",\"headRefOid\":\"7a268779392aaec63940c37ca5ab6185daca368f\",\"number\":229,\"title\":\"build(deps-dev): bump cf from 1.0.0-beta.10 to 1.0.0-beta.20 in /experiments/cloudflare-artifacts-vertical-slice/fork-worker\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/229\"},{\"baseRefName\":\"main\",\"headRefName\":\"dependabot/npm_and_yarn/experiments/cloudflare-artifacts-vertical-slice/shared-ref-worker/vite-8.3.5\",\"headRefOid\":\"27251799010cdfde04e1c4f6257981088747e514\",\"number\":228,\"title\":\"build(deps-dev): bump vite from 8.3.4 to 8.3.5 in /experiments/cloudflare-artifacts-vertical-slice/shared-ref-worker\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/228\"},{\"baseRefName\":\"main\",\"headRefName\":\"dependabot/npm_and_yarn/experiments/cloudflare-artifacts-vertical-slice/vite-8.3.5\",\"headRefOid\":\"df9e5306d812db1a7298cae3a41705dd8821585f\",\"number\":227,\"title\":\"build(deps-dev): bump vite from 8.3.4 to 8.3.5 in /experiments/cloudflare-artifacts-vertical-slice\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/227\"},{\"baseRefName\":\"main\",\"headRefName\":\"dependabot/npm_and_yarn/experiments/cloudflare-artifacts-vertical-slice/fork-worker/vite-8.3.5\",\"headRefOid\":\"2f9d1eec287779e185330e1d81c8fd9e92138cfe\",\"number\":226,\"title\":\"build(deps-dev): bump vite from 8.3.4 to 8.3.5 in /experiments/cloudflare-artifacts-vertical-slice/fork-worker\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/226\"},{\"baseRefName\":\"main\",\"headRefName\":\"dependabot/npm_and_yarn/experiments/cloudflare-artifacts-vertical-slice/agent-collab-worker/cf-1.0.0-beta.20\",\"headRefOid\":\"72094b3217811c2e6f75775e77a85986fc86adae\",\"number\":225,\"title\":\"build(deps-dev): bump cf from 1.0.0-beta.10 to 1.0.0-beta.20 in /exp