{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T14:20:39.077Z","ordinal":342045,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17359-3515-7cd3-8706-e6bd2e3432cb","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016ade103647c881a0b6a62dad775d11db","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"I’ve confirmed the screenshot is from an uncheckpointed auto-mode turn: Nexus stopped before starting the task, and its recovery path now has a pending fix that presents explicit choices. The source changes are isolated, but the repository’s serial test-suite claim is still held, so I’m continuing with code-path diagnosis and independent review rather than starting conflicting tests."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1792938038308,"completed_at_ms":1792938039076}}
