{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T14:24:22.356Z","ordinal":342243,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_01a17372-bf54-70a1-94a7-5716ee0d77d4","call_id":"call_21d4c5e28bec470e9820a11f7b4c17f9","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/current_main_rc_path_audit\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"PR #232 remains open at the reviewed head. I did not merge it. GitHub rejected the approval because the connected account is the PR author, so another reviewer must record the formal approval.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/plan05_readonly_review\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"**CHANGES_REQUIRED** — base/HEAD `b29f40b7b7a2d9c09f92e9111713633b1f5810d5`; uncommitted diff SHA-256 `6a09683e3dfeb00f949271b700c54c4643caf2ca6336208bb2bdf4998f13faab`.\\n\\nThe failed-checkpoint flow correctly pauses before starting the turn, preserves fail-closed checkpoint creation, and offers all five choices. The 40×14 regression also checks that the failure reason and choices fit.\\n\\nOne disclosure gap remains: for a generic checkpoint failure, [live_view.rs](/home/mike/nexus-wt/checkpoint-protected-git/core/src/bin/nexus_tui/live_view.rs:242) strips the choice enumeration and displays only the failure reason, while option 3 is labeled “Create checkpoint anyway.” It omits that retrying allows sensitive persistence. The sidecar message does include that warning at [sidecar.ts](/home/mike/nexus-wt/checkpoint-protected-git/cli/src/sidecar.ts:558), but the TUI hides it. Keep a concise sensitive-persistence warning visible in this modal and assert it at 40×14. I did not edit files or run tests.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/t4_runner_independent_review\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"ACCEPT — after the child’s `close` event, `kill()` now only attempts cgroup cleanup and cannot signal a potentially reused PID or create lingering timers. Before `close`, immediate and repeated cgroup cleanup behavior is preserved. The diff check was clean; I did not run tests.\"}}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17359-3515-7cd3-8706-e6bd2e3432cb","create_time":1792938262.356352}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
