trix (24)\\\",\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-25T14:20:06Z\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"COMPLETED\\\",\\\"workflowName\\\":\\\"CI\\\"},{\\\"__typename\\\":\\\"CheckRun\\\",\\\"completedAt\\\":\\\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\\\",\\\"conclusion\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"detailsUrl\\\":\\\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40201732816/job/121198211790\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"linux-x86_64\\\",\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-25T14:37:16Z\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"IN_PROGRESS\\\",\\\"workflowName\\\":\\\"CI\\\"},{\\\"__typename\\\":\\\"CheckRun\\\",\\\"completedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-25T14:21:14Z\\\",\\\"conclusion\\\":\\\"SUCCESS\\\",\\\"detailsUrl\\\":\\\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/runs/121194420181\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"CodeQL\\\",\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-25T14:21:11Z\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"COMPLETED\\\",\\\"workflowName\\\":\\\"\\\"},{\\\"__typename\\\":\\\"StatusContext\\\",\\\"context\\\":\\\"CodeRabbit\\\",\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-25T14:20:10Z\\\",\\\"state\\\":\\\"SUCCESS\\\",\\\"targetUrl\\\":\\\"\\\"}]}\\n{\\\"active\\\":\\\"Run npm --prefix cli test\\\",\\\"conclusion\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"linux-x86_64\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"in_progress\\\"}\\n{\\\"headRefOid\\\":\\\"403d6de657542a50cdbcfe714751870835505888\\\",\\\"mergeStateStatus\\\":\\\"BLOCKED\\\",\\\"statusCheckRollup\\\":[{\\\"__typename\\\":\\\"CheckRun\\\",\\\"completedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-25T14:29:57Z\\\",\\\"conclusion\\\":\\\"SUCCESS\\\",\\\"detailsUrl\\\":\\\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40201081936/job/121192204863\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"test-matrix (22)\\\",\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-25T14:11:42Z\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"COMPLETED\\\",\\\"workflowName\\\":\\\"CI\\\"},{\\\"__typename\\\":\\\"CheckRun\\\",\\\"completedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-25T14:12:54Z\\\",\\\"conclusion\\\":\\\"SUCCESS\\\",\\\"detailsUrl\\\":\\\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40201081931/job/121192205029\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"javascript-typescript\\\",\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-25T14:11:42Z\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"COMPLETED\\\",\\\"workflowName\\\":\\\"CodeQL\\\"},{\\\"__typename\\\":\\\"CheckRun\\\",\\\"completedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-25T14:29:04Z\\\",\\\"conclusion\\\":\\\"SUCCESS\\\",\\\"detailsUrl\\\":\\\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40201081936/job/121192205067\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"test-matrix (24)\\\",\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-25T14:11:42Z\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"COMPLETED\\\",\\\"workflowName\\\":\\\"CI\\\"},{\\\"__typename\\\":\\\"CheckRun\\\",\\\"completedAt\\\":\\\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\\\",\\\"conclusion\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"detailsUrl\\\":\\\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40201081936/job/121196479657\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"linux-x86_64\\\",\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-25T14:29:59Z\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"IN_PROGRESS\\\",\\\"workflowName\\\":\\\"CI\\\"},{\\\"__typename\\\":\\\"CheckRun\\\",\\\"completedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-25T14:12:47Z\\\",\\\"conclusion\\\":\\\"SUCCESS\\\",\\\"detailsUrl\\\":\\\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/runs/121192462135\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"CodeQL\\\",\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-25T14:12:44Z\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"COMPLETED\\\",\\\"workflowName\\\":\\\"\\\"},{\\\"__typename\\\":\\\"StatusContext\\\",\\\"context\\\":\\\"CodeRabbit\\\",\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-25T14:11:45Z\\\",\\\"state\\\":\\\"SUCCESS\\\",\\\"targetUrl\\\":\\\"\\\"}]}\\n\"}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"c99964\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000035623,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":909,\"output\":\"2026-10-25T14:21:20Z\\tSAFE_BOUNDARY_REQUEST: CHECKPOINT_PROTECTED_GIT_20261025 is ready for targeted validation; SUITE owner KimiCode-defect-scan, please release SUITE at a safe boundary or record the active run/next boundary. No tests will start until ownership is clear.\\n2026-10-25T14:26:02Z\\tCHECKPOINT_PROTECTED_GIT_20261025: COMMIT 75450b4; PR #236 opened against main at b29f40b; independent source review ACCEPT; TypeScript noEmit and Rust cargo check passed; PR exact-head CI running; SUITE safe-boundary requested and local tests remain unrun.\\n2026-10-25T14:27:06Z CLAIM DEFECT_RUNNER_BACKGROUND_TRACKING_20261025 runner.rs base=b29f40b scope=background-true-no-service-not-lingering\\n2026-10-25T14:29:13Z CLAIM_WITHDRAWN DEFECT_RUNNER_BACKGROUND_TRACKING_20261025: hypothesis false. run_command_tracked calls registry::finish(k) unconditionally after the background startup grace (runner.rs:680), so a background:true call without service_name is already moved to lingering and end_background_commands kills it. The pre-fix regression passed; no fix/PR.\\n2026-10-25T14:29:33Z CHECKIN opencode-defect-scan iteration 6: merged PR#210 required-attestation fail-closed (a3e1b65; post-merge CI/CodeQL success). Audited runner background lifecycle hypothesis and withdrew it after the pre-fix regression passed (registry::finish already runs at runner.rs:680). Remaining v1 blockers are owned: RC6 version bump PR#234, attestation auto default PR#235, checkpoint prompt PR#236, RC5 readiness PR#232. No unowned high-confidence code blocker claimed. Main=b29f40b; no release/acceptance claim.\\n2026-10-25T14:30:08Z CLAIM DEFECT_STATE_IDENTITY_PATH_20261025 state.ts base=b29f40b scope=taskid-path-traversal-delete/load\\n2026-10-25T14:30:32Z CLAIM_WITHDRAWN DEFECT_STATE_IDENTITY_PATH_20261025: hypothesis false; origin/main already validates task identity in getStateFilePath (state.ts:337), so the pre-fix traversal test passes. No fix/PR.\\n2026-10-25T14:31:25Z CLAIM DEFECT_UI_TERMINAL_INJECTION_20261025 ui.ts base=b29f40b scope=terminal-escape-injection-tool-output/plan/diff/code\\n2026-10-25T14:34:25Z CLAIM_UPDATE DEFECT_UI_TERMINAL_INJECTION_20261025 PR=#237 head=ca29a1032bfbffb8acd28732645dd37b1de52971 focused_ui_test_pass redact_test_pass tsc_pass pre_fix_OSC_leak_confirmed independent_review=pending\\n2026-10-25T14:35:28Z\\tCHECKPOINT_PROTECTED_GIT_20261025: PR #236 run 40202163967 failed both Node 22/24 only because Rust 40x14 test expected phrases unwrapped; CI-rendered modal showed full reason, sensitive warning, five choices. Test changed to visible fragments, independently re-reviewed ACCEPT, commit 7985668 pushed. Replacement run 40202421358: CodeQL passes; Node 22/24 suites in progress. No local suite run while SUITE claim remains with KimiCode-defect-scan.\\n2026-10-25T14:36:53Z\\tATTESTATION_AUTO_DEFAULT_20261025 REVIEW_HANDOFF: Independent review of PR #235 found install.sh defaults an explicitly empty NEXUS_VERIFY_ATTESTATION to auto via ${VAR:-auto}, contrary to SPEC-12 accepted-values contract and upgrade.ts nullish-default behavior. Owner claude-code retains ATTESTATION_AUTO_DEFAULT_20261025 and FILE_install.sh / FILE_scripts_installer-smoke.sh claims. Please change defaulting to distinguish unset from empty and add blank-value installer smoke coverage; preserve scope, rerun exact checks, then request independent re-review. No files edited by reviewer.\\n2026-10-25T14:38:16Z UPDATE DEFECT_UI_TERMINAL_INJECTION_20261025 head=37549f153ceccc7b8ccf5739b10590145b610f46 REJECT_addressed: turnSummary_status_and_inference_origin_sanitized, expanded_test, NEXUS_DEBUG_restore, CR residual; re_review_pending\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17359-3515-7cd3-8706-e6bd2e3432cb","create_time":1792939621.6564918}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
