{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T14:47:07.051Z","ordinal":343043,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016ade166a896081a0bad89854e922c430","status":"completed","call_id":"call_8a29f754b842442f8095db0934cb88b0","name":"exec","input":"const hs=ALL_TOOLS.filter(t=>t.name.includes(\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__\")&&/(list_agents|fetch_inbox|send_message|register_agent)/.test(t.name)); text(hs.map(t=>t.name+\"\\n\"+t.description.slice(0,700)).join(\"\\n---\\n\"));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17359-3515-7cd3-8706-e6bd2e3432cb","create_time":1792939626.5395012}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T14:47:07.121Z","ordinal":343044,"type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17359-3515-7cd3-8706-e6bd2e3432cb","session_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","root_turn_id":"01a17359-3515-7cd3-8706-e6bd2e3432cb","response_id":"resp_060b64278a9dfb15016ade1665e8e481a0a9c264158f5a77b2","usage":{"input_tokens":98685,"cached_input_tokens":95360,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":569,"reasoning_output_tokens":489,"total_tokens":99254},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":32948317,"cached_input_tokens":32572032,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":106696,"reasoning_output_tokens":65504,"total_tokens":33055013},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":6261473698,"cached_input_tokens":6194504320,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":17858969,"reasoning_output_tokens":10314915,"total_tokens":6279332667}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T14:47:07.127Z","ordinal":343045,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a17387-9277-7d30-b02a-a8fd22166336","call_id":"call_8a29f754b842442f8095db0934cb88b0","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__deregister_agent\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nRemove an agent from a project. Marks the agent as inactive and removes it from the active roster. Messages from/to the agent are preserved for audit but the agent can no longer send or receive new messages.\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__deregister_agent(args: { agent_name: string; project_key: string; registration_token?: string | null; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: string]:\n---\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_inbox\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nRetrieve recent messages for an agent without mutating read/ack state.\n\nFilters\n-------\n- `urgent_only`: only messages with importance in {high, urgent}\n- `since_ts`: ISO-8601 timestamp string; messages strictly newer than this are returned\n- `limit`: max number of messages (default 20)\n- `include_bodies`: include full Markdown bodies in the payloads\n- `topic`: filter to messages with this topic tag\n\nUsage patterns\n--------\n---\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__register_agent\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nCreate or update an agent identity within a project and persist its profile to Git.\n\nWhen to use\n-----------\n- At the start of a coding session by any automated agent.\n- To update an existing agent's program/model/task metadata and bump last_active.\n\nSemantics\n---------\n- If `name` is omitted, a random adjective+noun name is auto-generated.\n- Reusing the same `name` updates the profile (program/model/task) and\n  refreshes `\n---\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__send_message\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nSend a Markdown message to one or more recipients and persist canonical and mailbox copies to Git.\n\nDiscovery\n---------\nTo discover available agent names for recipients, use: resource://agents/{project_key}\nAgent names are NOT the same as program names or user names.\n\nWhat this does\n--------------\n- Stores message (and recipients) in the database; updates sender's activity\n- Writes a canonical `.md` under `messages/YYYY/MM/"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17359-3515-7cd3-8706-e6bd2e3432cb","create_time":1792939627.1271574}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
