{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T14:47:18.469Z","ordinal":343059,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_01a17387-bec5-7540-93ad-13075de9df12","call_id":"call_c0c82d2d56db4f39a88cd2070551624d","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/current_main_rc_path_audit\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"**CHANGES_REQUIRED**\\n\\n- `install.sh:21` uses `${NEXUS_VERIFY_ATTESTATION:-auto}`, which treats an explicitly empty value as `auto`. But [SPEC-12:95](/home/mike/nexus-code/docs/v1.0.0/specs/SPEC-12-cli-and-tui-upgrade.md:95) says other values are rejected, and the upgrade command rejects an empty value. Distinguish unset from empty in the installer and add a blank-value smoke case so malformed configuration fails closed.\\n\\nThe automatic fallback notices are visible in both installer and upgrade flows. Explicit `NEXUS_VERIFY_ATTESTATION=0` remains silent. The changes are compatible with the GitHub-installer-only release target; they do not add npm publishing behavior.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/plan05_readonly_review\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/t4_runner_independent_review\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"ACCEPT for PR #234’s version synchronization and RC6 sequencing. The root, CLI, and Rust package versions are all `1.0.0-rc.6`, including their lockfile entries. The release note correctly describes RC6 as an unaccepted candidate whose qualification must use workflow-produced artifacts.\\n\\n**It is not ready to merge or tag yet:** PR #234 is open and blocked, has no reviews, and its Linux packaging check is still running. After exact-head checks and independent review, merge through the approved path; then require stable-main checks and completion of authorized critical fixes before tagging RC6. No tests, tags, or publication were performed.\"}}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17359-3515-7cd3-8706-e6bd2e3432cb","create_time":1792939638.4695544}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
