{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T14:49:01.275Z","ordinal":343186,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016ade16dadf1c81a0949e45775fb1b6f1","status":"completed","call_id":"call_cbb90585509446ef96d2ccd4b35b08a7","name":"exec","input":"const r = await tools.mcp__codex_apps__github_add_review_to_pr({\n  action:\"REQUEST_CHANGES\",\n  commit_id:\"37549f153ceccc7b8ccf5739b10590145b610f46\",\n  pr_number:237,\n  repo_full_name:\"mikeholownych/nexus-code\",\n  review:\"Independent review against exact head 37549f153ceccc7b8ccf5739b10590145b610f46. The sanitizer changes do not cover these raw stdout paths, so terminal escape sequences can still reach the user's terminal. Please sanitize both paths at the output boundary and add regression tests before treating terminal safety as closed.\",\n  file_comments:[\n    {path:\"cli/src/agent.ts\",line:5363,side:\"RIGHT\",body:\"This stream callback writes model tokens directly to stdout. A response that contains OSC/CSI controls (including text echoed from hostile workspace or tool output) bypasses `TerminalUI.safeTerminal` and can still manipulate the terminal. Sanitize at this streaming write boundary and add a test that exercises the actual callback path.\"},\n    {path:\"cli/src/agent.ts\",line:6112,side:\"RIGHT\",body:\"The task prompt is user-controlled and printed raw here before inference. Terminal control characters in the prompt can execute in the terminal before the agent starts. Apply the same terminal-safe output handling and add a prompt-rendering regression test; also audit adjacent direct `console.log` output for untrusted workspace/model values.\"}\n  ]\n});\ntext(r);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17359-3515-7cd3-8706-e6bd2e3432cb","create_time":1792939738.873425}}}
