{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T14:49:05.454Z","ordinal":343193,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016ade16dfccc481a0bb9e7f6fdcd8d5ac","status":"completed","call_id":"call_3fe52fd96d2e4cf5af200c4b14404181","name":"exec","input":"const r = await tools.mcp__codex_apps__github_add_review_to_pr({\n  action:\"REQUEST_CHANGES\",\n  commit_id:\"37549f153ceccc7b8ccf5739b10590145b610f46\",\n  pr_number:237,\n  repo_full_name:\"mikeholownych/nexus-code\",\n  review:\"Independent review against exact head 37549f153ceccc7b8ccf5739b10590145b610f46 found two remaining raw terminal output paths. `cli/src/agent.ts:5356-5363` streams model tokens with `process.stdout.write(token)`, bypassing `TerminalUI.safeTerminal`; model output can carry OSC/CSI sequences, including hostile content echoed from workspace/tool output. `cli/src/agent.ts:6112-6117` prints the user-controlled task prompt raw before inference, so prompt control characters can reach the terminal. Please sanitize at both output boundaries, audit adjacent direct output of untrusted workspace/model values, and add regression tests for streamed output and prompt rendering. The PR's existing sanitizer does not close these paths.\"\n});\ntext(r);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17359-3515-7cd3-8706-e6bd2e3432cb","create_time":1792939743.801983}}}
