{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T14:49:38.919Z","ordinal":343223,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a17389-e367-7662-ac57-1beb116f9557","call_id":"call_76b95698077c4810a8726be71123ea92","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 4.7 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"429fb4\",\"wall_time_seconds\":2.045519523,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":127,\"output\":\"40203737532\\t7b964082\\tCodeQL\\tcompleted\\tsuccess\\n40203737531\\t7b964082\\tCI\\tin_progress\\t\\n40203171815\\t37549f15\\tCI\\tin_progress\\t\\n40203171783\\t37549f15\\tCodeQL\\tcompleted\\tsuccess\\n40202862363\\tca29a103\\tCodeQL\\tcompleted\\tsuccess\\n40202862341\\tca29a103\\tCI\\tin_progress\\t\\n40202421358\\t79856680\\tCI\\tcompleted\\tfailure\\n40202421356\\t79856680\\tCodeQL\\tcompleted\\tsuccess\\n40202163982\\t75450b4c\\tCodeQL\\tcompleted\\tsuccess\\n40202163967\\t75450b4c\\tCI\\tcompleted\\tfailure\\n40201732816\\t5bdd788e\\tCI\\tin_progress\\t\\n40201732801\\t5bdd788e\\tCodeQL\\tcompleted\\tsuccess\\n\"}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"482e49\",\"wall_time_seconds\":1.79515358,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":215,\"output\":\"{\\\"comments\\\":[{\\\"author\\\":\\\"mikeholownych\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"Independent read-only review of exact head `37549f153ceccc7b8ccf5739b10590145b610f46` found two terminal injection paths still outside this PR's sanitizer. `cli/src/agent.ts:5356-5363` writes streamed model tokens directly with `process.stdout.write(token)`, so OSC/CSI sequences in a response (including hostile workspace/tool content echoed by the model) still reach the terminal. `cli/src/agent.ts:6112-6117` prints the user-controlled task prompt raw before inference. Please sanitize both at their output boundaries, audit adjacent direct output of untrusted workspace/model fields, and add regression tests for actual streamed tokens and prompt rendering. The PR's current sanitizer does not close these paths.\\\",\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-25T14:49:09Z\\\"}],\\\"headRefOid\\\":\\\"37549f153ceccc7b8ccf5739b10590145b610f46\\\"}\\n\"}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"12edee\",\"wall_time_seconds\":1.553640146,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":390,\"output\":\"{\\\"comments\\\":[{\\\"author\\\":\\\"mikeholownych\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"Independent static review at current head `7b96408297959c0a6dcd1119ecc8f5770b8d150a`: the sensitive-persistence warning regression is corrected, but one release-blocking authority-reporting issue remains. In `cli/src/sidecar.ts`, the `without_checkpoint` branch clears `checkpointReadOnlyFallback` without calling `emitSessionState()` before `runTurn`. After an earlier read-only fallback, the TUI therefore continues to display read-only while the agent has already recovered configured review/auto authority. Please emit session state immediately after restoring the fallback flag, before the turn starts, and add a two-turn regression that checks both the immediate `session.state` event and restored tool authority. Tests were not run by this reviewer.\\\",\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-25T14:49:26Z\\\"}],\\\"reviews\\\":[{\\\"author\\\":\\\"mikeholownych\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"Independent review of exact head `7b96408297959c0a6dcd1119ecc8f5770b8d150a` against base `b29f40b7b7a2d9c09f92e9111713633b1f5810d5`. ACCEPT. The exact three-file diff matches the reviewed checkpoint-failure flow: checkpoint errors pause the turn, the 40x14 TUI keeps the reason, sensitive-persistence warning, and all five choices visible, and choosing sensitive retry emits a notice that the turn stays paused until success or another choice. Diff SHA-256: `faa620d34101319b4401cd22a8e6bbadd3f3ff38a3fd78236292325b495521c8`. Source review only; I did not run tests. This does not establish release acceptance.\\\",\\\"state\\\":\\\"COMMENTED\\\",\\\"submittedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-25T14:47:16Z\\\"}]}\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17359-3515-7cd3-8706-e6bd2e3432cb","create_time":1792939778.9190774}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
