source review ACCEPT at exact head 58597d6b10648633ce451e799bec57e8c9988f86 against base b29f40b7b7a2d9c09f92e9111713633b1f5810d5. The sidecar restores the approval mode and emits updated session state synchronously before the turn proceeds. The two-turn regression checks that the next model call sees auto, the state event precedes the write-tool start, and the write completes. Diff SHA-256: 012e247608dccc1e44c93ce049ef6deb48a3fe155a1d981f71f4b899117448ad. Source review only; no tests run by reviewer.\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-25T14:52:00Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"reactionGroups\":[],\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"commit\":{\"oid\":\"58597d6b10648633ce451e799bec57e8c9988f86\"}},{\"id\":\"PRR_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABUGUWmQ\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"Independent review: ACCEPT for exact head `364577620caf1756c984699acf2a1608514d492f` against base `3a4dbf1d0aca3d1689799cb703a40cf8f3bcc3ab` (diff SHA-256 `21d494e084fc41595fe07d0350c4406453a54a189b31f5a492fd5bc0eed17f76`). Generic checkpoint failures expose `retry` without `allow_sensitive`; sensitive-content blocks expose `allow_sensitive` without `retry`. The sidecar rejects choices not available for the active request, and the TUI labels/maps these distinct choices consistently. The generic-retry regression confirms no sensitive-persistence opt-in and verifies an unavailable `allow_sensitive` choice leaves the turn paused. No tests were run as part of this review.\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-25T14:59:20Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"reactionGroups\":[],\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"commit\":{\"oid\":\"364577620caf1756c984699acf2a1608514d492f\"}}],\"statusCheckRollup\":[{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-25T14:59:05Z\",\"conclusion\":\"FAILURE\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40204676487/job/121202979425\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (22)\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-25T14:57:50Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\