{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T15:04:19.208Z","ordinal":344055,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016ade1a6f6f6c81a0abd990f7e4ce16ba","status":"completed","call_id":"call_678c32228473487c8640703d5b46b8a7","name":"exec","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"cat > /tmp/nexus-pr236-body.md <<'EOF'\\n## Summary\\n\\n- Pause before starting the turn when checkpoint creation fails.\\n- For a generic checkpoint failure, offer: read-only, continue without a rollback checkpoint, retry normally, cancel, or re-enter the instruction.\\n- When sensitive content blocks checkpointing, offer: read-only, continue without a rollback checkpoint, explicitly allow sensitive persistence, cancel, or re-enter the instruction.\\n- Reject a choice that is not available for the active failure. A normal retry does not newly grant sensitive-persistence permission.\\n- Keep all five choices and the failure cause visible in the TUI at 40x14.\\n- Do not start the turn until checkpoint creation succeeds or the user explicitly selects another path.\\n\\n## Validation\\n\\n- `git diff --check`: PASS.\\n- `tsc --noEmit`: PASS on the earlier source head.\\n- `cargo check --bin nexus-tui`: PASS on the earlier source head.\\n- Full local tests were not run because the shared `SUITE` claim is held by KimiCode-defect-scan.\\n- Exact-head CI is running for `ae1f1afd1f29c8d6c49ce34f86eb07dcc9a23fdd` (run 40205095174); prior exact-head CI found the 40x14 warning crowded out option 5, and the UI text was shortened while preserving the reason and all choices.\\n- Independent source review: ACCEPT at exact head `ae1f1afd1f29c8d6c49ce34f86eb07dcc9a23fdd` against base `3a4dbf1d0aca3d1689799cb703a40cf8f3bcc3ab`.\\n\\n## Evidence\\n\\n- Base: `3a4dbf1d0aca3d1689799cb703a40cf8f3bcc3ab`\\n- Head: `ae1f1afd1f29c8d6c49ce34f86eb07dcc9a23fdd`\\n- Acceptance: IN_PROGRESS; this PR does not establish RC or release acceptance.\\nEOF\\ngh pr edit 236 --body-file /tmp/nexus-pr236-body.md && gh pr view 236 --json body,headRefOid,baseRefOid,url\",workdir:\"/home/mike/nexus-code\",yield_time_ms:10000,max_output_tokens:1600}); text(r.output);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17359-3515-7cd3-8706-e6bd2e3432cb","create_time":1792940655.4372237}}}
