ails.\\n- For a generic checkpoint failure, offer: read-only, continue without a rollback checkpoint, retry normally, cancel, or re-enter the instruction.\\n- When sensitive content blocks checkpointing, offer: read-only, continue without a rollback checkpoint, explicitly allow sensitive persistence, cancel, or re-enter the instruction.\\n- Reject a choice that is not available for the active failure. A normal retry does not newly grant sensitive-persistence permission.\\n- Keep all five choices and the failure cause visible in the TUI at 40x14.\\n- Do not start the turn until checkpoint creation succeeds or the user explicitly selects another path.\\n\\n## Validation\\n\\n- `git diff --check`: PASS.\\n- `tsc --noEmit`: PASS on the earlier source head.\\n- `cargo check --bin nexus-tui`: PASS on the earlier source head.\\n- Full local tests were not run because the shared `SUITE` claim is held by KimiCode-defect-scan.\\n- Exact-head CI is running for `b12d17f93862726913329d458744c04b0d68c827` (run 40205538352); prior exact-head CI found the 40x14 warning crowded out option 5, and the UI text was shortened while preserving the reason and all choices.\\n- Independent source review: ACCEPT at exact head `b12d17f93862726913329d458744c04b0d68c827` against base `3a4dbf1d0aca3d1689799cb703a40cf8f3bcc3ab`.\\n\\n## Evidence\\n\\n- Base: `3a4dbf1d0aca3d1689799cb703a40cf8f3bcc3ab`\\n- Head: `b12d17f93862726913329d458744c04b0d68c827`\\n- Acceptance: IN_PROGRESS; this PR does not establish RC or release acceptance.\\n\",\"headRefOid\":\"b12d17f93862726913329d458744c04b0d68c827\"}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":2,"nanos":232146280}},"started_at_ms":1792941059201,"completed_at_ms":1792941061433}}
